WEBVTT

00:15.724 --> 00:17.934
RESIDENT PLAYBOOK

00:19.394 --> 00:22.313
EPISODE 8

00:41.416 --> 00:43.418
Doctor, in third grade,

00:44.252 --> 00:46.212
I was diving at a swimming pool.

00:48.631 --> 00:50.967
My face hit the pool floor,
and I broke my front teeth.

00:52.343 --> 00:54.137
-Okay.
-So,

00:55.597 --> 00:57.098
these are crowns.

00:58.641 --> 01:00.560
They could break during intubation,

01:00.643 --> 01:02.020
so I'm just reminding you.

01:02.103 --> 01:03.271
Yes, I'll be careful.

01:03.354 --> 01:04.522
Thank you.

01:05.899 --> 01:07.108
Are you going to start now?

01:07.192 --> 01:08.610
Yes, I'm ready.

01:09.527 --> 01:10.528
I'm not.

01:10.612 --> 01:11.905
Let me know when you're ready.

01:11.988 --> 01:13.490
The anesthesia's ready.

01:13.573 --> 01:15.492
Yes, we're wrapping up.

01:17.368 --> 01:18.286
I…

01:19.245 --> 01:21.081
want to go back.

01:23.666 --> 01:25.877
Hey, if the pathology results are out,

01:25.960 --> 01:28.338
you need to put them together
and send them to me.

01:28.421 --> 01:29.589
I'm sorry, sir.

01:30.381 --> 01:32.008
What about the cervical cancer data?

01:32.091 --> 01:33.968
I was going to email it to you today.

01:34.052 --> 01:37.847
Okay. That includes
the added patient data, right?

01:37.931 --> 01:39.098
Well…

01:40.725 --> 01:41.935
What, it doesn't?

01:43.436 --> 01:44.813
Damn it, seriously?

01:47.232 --> 01:48.066
Look, just

01:48.817 --> 01:50.485
put it together and send it by tomorrow.

01:52.612 --> 01:53.738
By tomorrow?

01:53.822 --> 01:55.865
Yeah, you need to send it
tomorrow at the latest,

01:55.949 --> 01:58.159
so I can add it to the paper.

01:59.494 --> 02:00.328
Hey, what's wrong?

02:00.411 --> 02:01.830
Hey, over here! Come here now!

02:01.913 --> 02:03.414
Hey, Sa-bi!

02:03.498 --> 02:05.917
What's the matter? Hey, Sa-bi!

02:10.296 --> 02:11.422
This…

02:15.927 --> 02:18.429
I think you'll need surgery.

02:18.513 --> 02:19.722
-Surgery?
-Laparoscopic?

02:19.806 --> 02:20.932
Is it bad?

02:21.015 --> 02:21.975
How big is the fibroid?

02:22.058 --> 02:23.184
It's not malignant, right?

02:23.268 --> 02:24.352
It looks pretty big.

02:25.103 --> 02:25.937
Professor.

02:27.897 --> 02:30.191
Hey. Excuse me.

02:30.275 --> 02:31.609
-Hello.
-Hello.

02:31.693 --> 02:32.694
Don't you all have work?

02:33.361 --> 02:34.571
Sir, we have the lab results.

02:34.654 --> 02:37.615
Hemoglobin is 6.2,
so I prescribed two units of RBC.

02:37.699 --> 02:39.200
My goodness.

02:39.951 --> 02:41.911
You must have been really dizzy.

02:43.621 --> 02:46.624
I called Anesthesiology.
OR 3's last slot tomorrow was canceled.

02:46.708 --> 02:47.542
What should we do?

02:48.459 --> 02:49.460
What should we do?

02:51.421 --> 02:53.214
Well? Ms. Resident?

02:58.386 --> 02:59.429
I think we should.

02:59.512 --> 03:00.513
It's too big.

03:02.015 --> 03:02.932
Let's do the surgery.

03:06.352 --> 03:08.813
If we can see the myoma
from an abdominal ultrasound,

03:08.897 --> 03:10.273
then it must be huge, right?

03:10.356 --> 03:11.190
Didn't it hurt?

03:11.274 --> 03:12.233
Of course, it did.

03:12.317 --> 03:14.485
She was struggling for months
due to period cramps.

03:14.569 --> 03:17.113
I told you to have it checked immediately.

03:18.072 --> 03:19.574
She took a ton of meds for dizziness.

03:19.657 --> 03:22.243
It's anemia caused by bleeding.
Why take headache meds?

03:22.327 --> 03:23.202
I know, right?

03:23.286 --> 03:25.121
She pores over everyone else's charts.

03:25.204 --> 03:26.873
But she doesn't take care of herself.

03:26.956 --> 03:29.250
Hey, is it going to be
scolding or worrying?

03:29.334 --> 03:30.168
Just do one.

03:30.668 --> 03:32.837
She's already upset as it is
since she can't work.

03:35.965 --> 03:37.884
-Hello.
-Hello.

03:37.967 --> 03:39.677
You don't need any explanation, right?

03:40.678 --> 03:41.763
Did you fast?

03:41.846 --> 03:43.473
Yes. Not even a sip of water.

03:43.556 --> 03:44.849
She's not on any meds.

03:44.933 --> 03:46.392
And she signed the consent form.

03:46.476 --> 03:47.727
I'm her guardian.

03:47.810 --> 03:50.647
She's not telling her mom.
She said it would be more of a hassle.

03:51.940 --> 03:53.358
All right, then.

03:54.108 --> 03:54.943
Doctor.

03:55.568 --> 03:57.570
Could we stay with her
just until she's under--

03:57.654 --> 03:58.655
No.

03:58.738 --> 04:00.323
You'll make a ruckus in there.

04:00.406 --> 04:02.575
Please, Doctor.
She says she's really scared.

04:02.659 --> 04:04.535
She's been there
and seen this surgery a ton.

04:04.619 --> 04:05.954
What's there to be scared of?

04:06.537 --> 04:08.164
That's enough. I'll take care of it.

04:08.248 --> 04:09.457
Let go. Go on.

04:09.540 --> 04:11.417
-Just once--
-Just go, will you?

04:18.049 --> 04:19.008
Let's go already!

04:19.092 --> 04:20.343
For goodness' sake.

04:22.220 --> 04:23.638
Come back healthy and sound!

04:23.721 --> 04:25.974
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY
EXIT

04:32.188 --> 04:33.815
Here. You know how to put it on, right?

04:35.650 --> 04:36.651
Nam-kyung.

04:36.734 --> 04:38.528
I'm assisting. I forgot.

04:41.281 --> 04:42.115
Why you?

04:42.198 --> 04:43.533
Me? I'm on call.

04:43.616 --> 04:44.575
Where's Dr. Ki?

04:44.659 --> 04:45.618
She's in OB surgery.

04:45.702 --> 04:46.619
Dr. Ku?

04:46.703 --> 04:47.620
The delivery room.

04:49.414 --> 04:50.248
Hey.

04:50.331 --> 04:51.416
I'd rather it be Yi-young.

04:51.499 --> 04:53.167
She at least sutures well.

04:54.460 --> 04:56.379
Hey! Yi-young!

04:57.046 --> 04:58.715
Yi-young!

05:04.053 --> 05:04.887
What is it?

05:06.431 --> 05:07.515
Nothing.

05:07.598 --> 05:08.891
I must be hearing things.

05:11.185 --> 05:12.603
Sa-bi will be okay, right?

05:12.687 --> 05:13.855
Of course she will be.

05:13.938 --> 05:15.064
It's not a major surgery.

05:16.065 --> 05:17.233
The medication's going in.

05:37.754 --> 05:40.965
RESIDENT PLAYBOOK

05:46.929 --> 05:48.097
What is it now?

05:48.181 --> 05:49.974
What are you unhappy about this time?

05:52.018 --> 05:52.852
It's nothing.

05:56.564 --> 05:57.982
I mean…

05:58.066 --> 06:00.651
Couldn't the first-years come early?

06:00.735 --> 06:02.278
They can go on rounds in advance

06:02.361 --> 06:05.698
and brief the seniors
before the professors arrive.

06:05.782 --> 06:06.699
That'd be so nice.

06:07.325 --> 06:09.660
They don't know how to do that.

06:09.744 --> 06:11.162
We're lucky they show up at all.

06:12.872 --> 06:13.956
I guess so.

06:17.752 --> 06:20.797
But doesn't it feel like
something's missing today?

06:20.880 --> 06:22.381
-Right? You felt it too?
-Yes.

06:22.465 --> 06:25.218
I checked everything for the handover.

06:26.385 --> 06:28.304
Maybe it's because
Dr. Kim's been hospitalized.

06:28.387 --> 06:29.972
No, I don't think that's it.

06:30.807 --> 06:31.808
What time is it?

06:35.311 --> 06:36.312
He's not here.

06:39.607 --> 06:40.441
He's really not.

06:41.526 --> 06:42.568
Who?

06:42.652 --> 06:43.653
Dr. Ku.

06:45.988 --> 06:47.073
You're right!

06:47.156 --> 06:50.076
I mean, rain or shine…

06:50.159 --> 06:51.953
He's always here at this time.

06:53.204 --> 06:54.080
What happened?

06:55.373 --> 06:56.541
Is he sick?

07:02.296 --> 07:03.589
Can we play some music?

07:03.673 --> 07:05.800
Sure. I connected the Bluetooth for you.

07:06.717 --> 07:07.552
Nice.

07:13.891 --> 07:15.059
But is something wrong?

07:16.811 --> 07:19.021
I mean, you always left
at 4:00 a.m. on the dot.

07:19.105 --> 07:21.274
Why are you going into work with me today?

07:23.985 --> 07:24.986
I slept in.

07:26.612 --> 07:28.573
Is that even possible with you?

07:30.575 --> 07:32.702
You had a lot of stuff anyway,
so it worked out well.

07:35.163 --> 07:36.622
They don't let us go home

07:36.706 --> 07:38.666
or give us time to do laundry.

07:39.625 --> 07:42.420
I get why we're called residents.

07:42.503 --> 07:45.548
Because we live at the hospital.
Why do we even have our own homes?

07:47.675 --> 07:48.509
You don't.

07:49.969 --> 07:51.471
I had one too, okay?

07:51.554 --> 07:53.306
A 640-square-foot apartment
on jeonse lease.

07:55.057 --> 07:57.018
By the way, I was really curious.

07:57.810 --> 07:59.228
What happened to your deposit?

07:59.854 --> 08:01.397
It was used for a good cause.

08:03.274 --> 08:05.485
But why did you quit the local hospital?

08:06.068 --> 08:08.279
Well, you know.
It was for a variety of reasons.

08:08.362 --> 08:09.280
Then…

08:10.823 --> 08:11.908
Your overdraft account…

08:12.867 --> 08:14.702
I made big progress this month.

08:14.785 --> 08:17.455
It's now negative 29,708,000 won.

08:17.538 --> 08:18.706
That's impressive!

08:20.082 --> 08:21.459
But why are you suddenly curious?

08:22.335 --> 08:23.461
What?

08:24.045 --> 08:25.713
We've lived together for a year now,

08:25.796 --> 08:27.256
and you've never asked.

08:29.884 --> 08:30.885
I haven't?

08:33.429 --> 08:34.263
Do you…

08:36.390 --> 08:37.308
What?

08:41.729 --> 08:43.105
Do you think I'll ask for money?

08:45.233 --> 08:46.943
As if I had any money to lend.

08:50.154 --> 08:52.323
Can you pull over at the next street?

08:52.406 --> 08:53.824
-I have to buy something.
-Okay.

09:05.253 --> 09:06.629
-I'll be right back.
-Okay.

09:12.677 --> 09:14.971
HAM DONG-HO
REJECT ACCEPT

09:17.723 --> 09:19.934
HAM DONG-HO

09:29.569 --> 09:30.570
I stopped by on the way.

09:31.195 --> 09:32.530
Your usual with extra sauce.

09:33.114 --> 09:35.366
Thanks. I've been craving this.

09:35.992 --> 09:36.993
I'll eat it later.

09:37.743 --> 09:38.828
Hey, Sa-bi.

09:38.911 --> 09:41.497
I heard you had bad nausea
early this morning from the epidural.

09:41.581 --> 09:42.415
Are you okay?

09:43.165 --> 09:44.041
Yeah.

09:44.125 --> 09:45.376
-By the way, Nam-kyung.
-Yeah?

09:45.459 --> 09:46.877
When you did the dressing,

09:47.461 --> 09:50.006
I noticed it came a bit undone here.

09:51.507 --> 09:52.633
No, it's not.

09:52.717 --> 09:54.760
You're just mistaken
since you're still dizzy.

09:59.140 --> 10:01.058
I'll put on some Steri-Strips later.

10:01.684 --> 10:04.061
You did the sutures half-heartedly,
didn't you?

10:04.145 --> 10:06.188
Who do you think I am?

10:06.272 --> 10:07.148
Hey, Sa-bi!

10:07.732 --> 10:08.608
Are you okay?

10:08.691 --> 10:11.277
Gosh, you were snoring
so loudly this morning.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.486
It wasn't me!

10:12.570 --> 10:15.031
Jae-il, did you prescribe the NSAIDs?

10:15.114 --> 10:16.032
Oh, right.

10:16.949 --> 10:18.868
I'm in real pain.

10:18.951 --> 10:21.370
The PCA's out now, so it's really painful!

10:21.454 --> 10:23.039
Goodness, don't be such a baby.

10:23.581 --> 10:24.624
I'll do it for you later.

10:24.707 --> 10:25.791
Forget it. I'll do it.

10:25.875 --> 10:27.877
No, I'll call Nurse Ju-yeon now.

10:31.047 --> 10:31.881
Is that a new phone?

10:31.964 --> 10:32.798
Yeah.

10:33.799 --> 10:36.761
A clean break from the past.
A new phone for new beginnings.

10:36.844 --> 10:38.220
Hey, the NSAIDs first--

10:38.304 --> 10:39.347
It must be real this time.

10:39.430 --> 10:40.681
I guess they really broke up.

10:40.765 --> 10:42.183
Yeah, it's totally over.

10:42.725 --> 10:44.977
I erased all our chats,
his number, and photos.

10:45.561 --> 10:47.063
What was his number again?

10:47.688 --> 10:48.564
I really

10:49.315 --> 10:50.358
don't even remember.

10:50.441 --> 10:52.193
Instead of you saying it was over…

10:52.860 --> 10:53.986
I think he said it was over.

10:55.321 --> 10:57.615
Don't you usually call that
"being dumped?"

10:57.698 --> 10:58.658
My prescription first--

10:58.741 --> 10:59.950
Are we in high school?

11:00.034 --> 11:01.827
Dumped? I wasn't dumped.

11:02.536 --> 11:04.705
Don't pretend to know
when you've never dated before.

11:04.789 --> 11:06.457
Forget it. Just get out.

11:06.999 --> 11:07.833
Go.

11:07.917 --> 11:09.251
I have to go anyway.

11:09.335 --> 11:11.337
But before I do, try this.

11:12.129 --> 11:13.589
My lungs are normal.

11:13.673 --> 11:15.091
At my age, this isn't necessary.

11:15.925 --> 11:17.676
Still, do it. So we can see you're fine.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.844
Yeah, go on.

11:24.058 --> 11:25.851
Your lungs are fine. And your bowels?

11:28.104 --> 11:30.022
-Are you gassy?
-No.

11:30.606 --> 11:31.524
So go.

11:32.024 --> 11:33.275
Please go.

11:47.123 --> 11:47.957
There it is.

11:48.040 --> 11:49.208
We can tick that off.

11:49.291 --> 11:50.418
Well, they're working well.

11:51.627 --> 11:52.461
Bye!

11:52.962 --> 11:54.046
It wasn't me.

11:54.630 --> 11:56.132
I said it wasn't me!

11:57.091 --> 11:58.342
It wasn't me!

11:59.677 --> 12:02.388
Hey, I'm choosing lunch.

12:02.471 --> 12:03.389
See you later.

12:07.893 --> 12:08.727
Yes, Professor?

12:09.979 --> 12:11.230
Now?

12:11.856 --> 12:13.482
Okay, I'll attach the balloons.

12:13.566 --> 12:14.567
Okay, bye.

12:16.318 --> 12:17.945
Hey, Prof. Seo said to buy a cake.

12:18.028 --> 12:19.238
We're having a 100-day party.

12:20.364 --> 12:21.782
A 100-day party for what?

12:24.452 --> 12:25.286
So annoying.

12:25.870 --> 12:27.955
Why aren't you here? I'm done setting up.

12:28.539 --> 12:29.957
Where did you set up?

12:30.040 --> 12:30.958
Where are you?

12:32.251 --> 12:34.211
I've been waiting at NICU.

12:34.295 --> 12:35.671
You said there's a 100-day party.

12:35.754 --> 12:37.381
Geez, it's not there.

12:38.757 --> 12:39.800
Then where?

12:54.940 --> 12:56.859
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

13:05.826 --> 13:08.454
It's already been 100 days
since you were admitted.

13:08.537 --> 13:10.664
You've done so well in carrying the baby.

13:10.748 --> 13:14.835
But this is something
to be congratulated for, right?

13:14.919 --> 13:16.295
Of course.

13:16.378 --> 13:18.881
You're supposed to be celebrated
during the entire pregnancy.

13:18.964 --> 13:22.927
And you're unable to do that
with your family since you're stuck here.

13:23.010 --> 13:24.803
So we should help you celebrate.

13:25.387 --> 13:26.222
Is that so?

13:27.598 --> 13:28.432
Well,

13:29.016 --> 13:32.019
for 100 days, the mothers here
with high-risk pregnancies have had

13:32.102 --> 13:35.564
a lot of good and bad things
happen to them.

13:35.648 --> 13:38.692
I made it through
without any major incidents.

13:38.776 --> 13:40.945
Gosh, so I guess it is
a reason to celebrate.

13:42.196 --> 13:43.572
Thank you.

13:45.616 --> 13:46.534
Did you make a wish?

13:46.617 --> 13:47.451
Yes.

13:48.077 --> 13:51.038
Even if it meant I had to stay here
a thousand more days,

13:51.121 --> 13:54.208
I wished for my baby to be born healthy.

13:55.960 --> 13:58.337
I'm sure it's been hard staying here.

13:58.420 --> 14:00.214
And it's been very uncomfortable.

14:00.297 --> 14:01.465
Two years ago,

14:01.549 --> 14:04.301
I stayed here for 80 days
when I had my twins.

14:04.927 --> 14:07.513
So, I'm pretty used to things.

14:07.596 --> 14:10.015
But gosh, not seeing my twins,

14:10.849 --> 14:13.769
San and Deul, is kind of hard.

14:14.895 --> 14:16.855
Let's get through just two more weeks,

14:16.939 --> 14:19.108
have our 113-day party and…

14:19.191 --> 14:21.819
No, let's have a party
for the birth and go home.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.154
Okay.

14:25.281 --> 14:28.200
Shall we share the cake
with the other mothers here?

14:30.327 --> 14:31.662
Let's just have it between us.

14:31.745 --> 14:32.580
Between us?

14:32.663 --> 14:34.498
They just got here

14:35.624 --> 14:36.834
and haven't opened up yet.

14:46.218 --> 14:48.429
Hi, San and Deul!

14:48.512 --> 14:49.972
-Mommy!
-Mommy!

14:50.055 --> 14:51.098
Did you sleep well?

14:51.181 --> 14:52.266
Did you eat?

14:52.349 --> 14:54.226
-We had snacks!
-What?

14:54.310 --> 14:56.604
You can't eat snacks for breakfast!

14:58.480 --> 14:59.815
Where are you, Mommy?

14:59.899 --> 15:00.774
It's the doctors.

15:00.858 --> 15:02.610
-Hi, Doctors.
-Hi, Doctors.

15:05.529 --> 15:06.989
It's here!

15:07.072 --> 15:09.158
-It's here!
-Delicious tteokbokki is here!

15:09.241 --> 15:10.826
I can't wait!

15:10.910 --> 15:12.244
Why did it take so long?

15:12.328 --> 15:13.621
I was starving to death.

15:16.081 --> 15:17.207
This is going to be so good.

15:18.876 --> 15:19.960
Did you get two?

15:21.295 --> 15:22.379
Now, this is it.

15:22.463 --> 15:24.632
Gosh, I just had cake,
but this smells incredible.

15:24.715 --> 15:27.301
Doesn't eating cake
make you crave tteokbokki even more?

15:27.384 --> 15:28.636
Like a sweet and salty loop.

15:28.719 --> 15:30.888
But I feel bad for Sa-bi.

15:31.597 --> 15:32.723
This is her favorite.

15:32.806 --> 15:35.142
-Who cares? We can eat it again.
-That's right.

15:36.268 --> 15:38.479
Yo, Um Jay!
You didn't forget any toppings, did you?

15:38.562 --> 15:39.438
Of course not!

15:39.521 --> 15:41.857
-Just like Sa-bi told me, extra cheese!
-Yeah!

15:41.941 --> 15:43.484
-Extra sausages!
-Yeah!

15:43.567 --> 15:45.235
-And--
-And with glass noodles!

16:04.797 --> 16:06.966
You said we'd eat this together
when I was discharged.

16:12.513 --> 16:13.347
No.

16:13.889 --> 16:15.683
Put the fish cake on the rice ball.

16:18.268 --> 16:19.395
Yeah.

16:20.062 --> 16:22.147
Wrap the rice cake in cheese

16:22.231 --> 16:23.315
and eat with the sausage.

16:28.988 --> 16:30.239
It's so good!

16:31.907 --> 16:33.283
Can you roam around like this?

16:33.367 --> 16:35.744
I'm bored to death, so what else can I do?

16:35.828 --> 16:36.829
Bored?

16:37.579 --> 16:39.039
Damn it, I'm so jealous.

16:39.123 --> 16:40.582
I slept so much I can't sleep more.

16:41.166 --> 16:43.460
Hey, it's barely been a day
since your surgery.

16:44.044 --> 16:46.422
Hey, Yi-young.
I heard Ms. Ji's been here 100 days now.

16:46.505 --> 16:47.423
How did you know?

16:47.506 --> 16:49.341
I was bored,
so I looked at patients' charts.

16:50.175 --> 16:51.802
She's at 32 weeks and a day today.

16:52.302 --> 16:54.555
Counting backwards,
it's exactly 100 days since she came.

16:54.638 --> 16:56.181
That's why we had a party earlier.

16:57.641 --> 16:59.226
Has her cervix been all right?

16:59.309 --> 17:01.729
Yeah. It's been fine with meds.

17:01.812 --> 17:02.730
And the EBW?

17:03.439 --> 17:04.523
It's fine at this stage.

17:05.107 --> 17:07.526
It was at 1,900 grams
on the ultrasonography yesterday.

17:07.609 --> 17:10.320
-Good amniotic fluid levels?
-Yeah. I just checked and…

17:12.114 --> 17:14.199
Why don't you just do it then?
I'll stay in bed.

17:14.283 --> 17:15.701
Yeah, just do that.

17:15.784 --> 17:17.119
I wish I could.

17:17.786 --> 17:20.497
Hey! You have to dip
the rice ball in the sauce!

17:22.124 --> 17:24.001
If you're going to be
mad like that, just eat.

17:24.543 --> 17:25.586
You'll get a bad attitude.

17:26.628 --> 17:27.671
Then can I have just one?

17:28.255 --> 17:29.548
No, you eat this.

17:40.768 --> 17:41.810
-Ma'am?
-Yes?

17:41.894 --> 17:43.771
You've been like this the whole time?

17:45.731 --> 17:48.567
You've been lying
on your left side for days,

17:48.650 --> 17:50.277
so of course your arm is numb.

17:50.360 --> 17:52.571
I told her to lie on her back.

17:53.155 --> 17:55.115
But she didn't want to.

17:55.741 --> 17:57.117
I heard if some pregnant women

17:57.201 --> 17:58.327
lie flat on their back,

17:58.410 --> 18:00.704
they can faint from low blood pressure.

18:01.205 --> 18:03.957
I asked if that was true
and she said she didn't know.

18:08.670 --> 18:10.089
In late pregnancy,

18:10.756 --> 18:13.342
the uterus expands and becomes heavy,

18:13.425 --> 18:15.844
and lying on your back
may put pressure on blood vessels,

18:15.928 --> 18:17.429
which could lead to fainting.

18:17.513 --> 18:19.932
Then it helps to lie on your side.

18:23.519 --> 18:25.562
That's why people say that.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.440
Right, Dr. Oh?

18:29.691 --> 18:30.526
Yes.

18:31.193 --> 18:33.821
But you don't have to
worry about that yet.

18:33.904 --> 18:35.030
Really?

18:35.697 --> 18:37.533
Can I really lie on my back?

18:37.616 --> 18:38.534
Yes.

18:38.617 --> 18:42.037
If needed,
I'll tell you to lie on your side.

18:44.706 --> 18:45.624
Goodness.

18:46.416 --> 18:48.252
You must have read the same blog.

18:49.670 --> 18:50.587
Twins, right?

18:51.463 --> 18:53.590
By the looks of it, at 24 weeks?

18:54.216 --> 18:55.050
Yes.

18:55.592 --> 18:58.595
Twins, 24 weeks, left side, fainting.

18:58.679 --> 19:01.223
If you search online,
the top result that shows is…

19:01.306 --> 19:02.349
Was it Tiger Mom?

19:02.432 --> 19:03.308
Or Meow Mom?

19:03.392 --> 19:04.852
That's right. It's Tiger Mom!

19:04.935 --> 19:06.478
I read that too two years ago,

19:06.562 --> 19:08.730
so I only laid on my left side.

19:08.814 --> 19:10.440
I thought my arm was going to fall off.

19:12.025 --> 19:14.903
The professor told me the same thing,

19:14.987 --> 19:17.072
so I laid on my back after that,

19:17.156 --> 19:18.490
and everything was fine.

19:18.574 --> 19:19.992
I wondered

19:20.576 --> 19:21.994
where I'd heard this before.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.538
Those twins

19:24.621 --> 19:26.748
grew well into week 35

19:26.832 --> 19:28.959
and were born healthy at 2.9 kg.

19:29.543 --> 19:30.419
Really?

19:38.969 --> 19:39.803
Gosh, my arm.

19:42.806 --> 19:44.224
I'm a bit sad.

19:45.184 --> 19:47.895
I think you trust Yeon-du more than us.

19:47.978 --> 19:49.313
No, I don't.

19:49.396 --> 19:50.814
It's not that.

19:51.523 --> 19:54.151
I mean, she's been here a long time,

19:54.234 --> 19:55.444
so I trust her.

19:55.527 --> 19:58.280
If there's anything you don't know,
feel free to ask.

19:58.363 --> 20:00.991
I'm a high-risk pregnancy expert.

20:04.995 --> 20:06.246
"I'll find out."

20:06.830 --> 20:08.749
Not even "I'll ask the professor,"

20:08.832 --> 20:09.833
but "I don't know"?

20:10.500 --> 20:12.252
You think a resident should say that?

20:12.878 --> 20:13.962
I'm sorry.

20:14.046 --> 20:16.548
Yi-young. You're not afraid
of me anymore, are you?

20:17.341 --> 20:18.217
Right?

20:18.300 --> 20:20.260
No, I am afraid.

20:20.344 --> 20:21.887
I'm afraid of you,

20:22.554 --> 20:24.514
but I was more afraid of my own ignorance.

20:25.933 --> 20:28.185
So that's what you were afraid of?

20:29.061 --> 20:30.562
Then let me fix that for you.

20:31.939 --> 20:32.814
Sorry?

20:32.898 --> 20:34.233
Starting today,

20:34.316 --> 20:36.109
study a chapter of Williams a day,

20:36.193 --> 20:38.111
summarize it, and send it to me.

20:38.195 --> 20:40.113
I'll quiz you daily based on that.

20:40.864 --> 20:43.700
After doing that,
all your fears will disappear.

20:44.701 --> 20:46.286
-Professor--
-What?

20:47.162 --> 20:48.205
It's starting from today.

20:48.705 --> 20:50.290
You only have a few hours left.

20:58.757 --> 21:00.092
Doctor?

21:09.184 --> 21:10.060
Doctor.

21:10.644 --> 21:12.646
On the ultrasound this morning,

21:13.313 --> 21:16.858
I was wondering
if the cervical length looked okay.

21:16.942 --> 21:19.528
Right, I meant to tell you.

21:25.701 --> 21:27.577
I'm sorry, ma'am.

21:27.661 --> 21:30.580
It's maintaining well
at the same length it was three days ago.

21:32.833 --> 21:33.667
Okay.

21:33.750 --> 21:36.003
Umbilical blood flow looks good too.

21:36.086 --> 21:37.754
But, Doctor,

21:38.922 --> 21:40.465
you're a bit close…

21:43.302 --> 21:44.303
I'm sorry.

21:45.053 --> 21:47.014
This is what the professor
seemed to do, so…

21:48.682 --> 21:51.351
Gosh, you don't have to bend down so far.

21:55.314 --> 21:56.148
Right.

21:57.232 --> 22:01.486
Even sitting is hard for us,
so we're lying down most of the time.

22:02.154 --> 22:03.947
So she was trying to meet us at eye level.

22:04.740 --> 22:05.574
Right.

22:06.366 --> 22:08.744
Your ultrasound looked good. Don't worry.

22:10.412 --> 22:11.496
Thank you.

22:17.919 --> 22:19.755
I get that you're tired,

22:20.380 --> 22:22.841
but not replying to my text
from earlier today's a bit rude.

22:23.967 --> 22:25.385
Right. I'm sorry.

22:25.469 --> 22:26.470
I was so busy today.

22:27.137 --> 22:28.680
I asked if you were free tonight.

22:28.764 --> 22:30.474
I'm on call tonight.

22:32.142 --> 22:34.102
We haven't found time
for three weeks, you know.

22:34.186 --> 22:35.937
-Has it been that long?
-Yes.

22:36.772 --> 22:38.440
Then how about this Friday?

22:38.523 --> 22:39.983
Friday…

22:41.568 --> 22:43.320
I'm not on call, and I'm free.

22:43.403 --> 22:44.988
Really? You're free on Friday?

22:47.866 --> 22:48.700
Yes.

22:48.784 --> 22:50.952
Okay, in three days then. On Friday.

22:51.536 --> 22:52.579
Okay, sure.

22:52.662 --> 22:54.831
What would you like to eat?
What do you like?

22:54.915 --> 22:56.917
I like everything.

22:57.751 --> 22:58.752
Me too.

22:58.835 --> 23:00.128
Somewhere nearby is best, right?

23:02.547 --> 23:03.590
-Hello.
-Hello.

23:04.633 --> 23:05.467
Hello.

23:06.635 --> 23:08.053
What brings you here, Dr. Ham?

23:08.136 --> 23:09.763
I got a call for an epidural.

23:16.144 --> 23:17.062
Aren't you getting in?

23:18.355 --> 23:20.107
We still had things to talk about.

23:20.899 --> 23:21.942
Please go up first.

23:23.902 --> 23:25.362
I'll be up soon.

23:26.530 --> 23:27.364
Okay.

23:29.825 --> 23:31.451
I'll reserve a nice place nearby.

23:32.494 --> 23:33.328
Yi-young.

23:43.046 --> 23:44.089
Never mind. See you later.

23:44.631 --> 23:45.507
Have a nice day.

24:03.483 --> 24:04.484
HAM DONG-HO

24:05.902 --> 24:07.654
YOU DO HAVE A DAY WHEN YOU'RE FREE, RIGHT?

24:07.737 --> 24:09.322
Or maybe not?

24:09.906 --> 24:11.992
DON'T FORGET FRIDAY!
YOU'RE OKAY WITH ANYTHING?

24:12.075 --> 24:13.785
I'LL MESSAGE YOU
ONCE I HAVE THE PLACE

24:25.672 --> 24:28.633
Hey, I was curious about something.

24:29.634 --> 24:30.760
I have this friend.

24:32.888 --> 24:33.722
Your friend?

24:36.183 --> 24:37.017
Sorry.

24:37.100 --> 24:38.935
Yeah. She's an office worker.

24:39.019 --> 24:40.061
Let's say that's true.

24:40.145 --> 24:41.646
What is it? Is she sick?

24:41.730 --> 24:42.606
No.

24:43.106 --> 24:45.400
Someone keeps asking her
to have dinner together.

24:46.610 --> 24:47.944
It was a big surgery… I mean…

24:48.486 --> 24:50.405
They worked on a big project together.

24:50.488 --> 24:52.157
And I guess she helped him out a lot.

24:52.240 --> 24:53.909
-He must be thankful.
-He likes her.

24:55.243 --> 24:57.120
But there's someone else she likes.

24:57.204 --> 24:59.748
So should she have dinner with him or not?

24:59.831 --> 25:01.541
-Sure.
-No.

25:02.834 --> 25:04.336
Asking to have dinner

25:04.419 --> 25:05.712
means it's a date.

25:06.546 --> 25:07.839
No, it's not.

25:07.923 --> 25:09.216
He's just saying,

25:09.299 --> 25:11.343
"Let's have a meal
since we worked hard together."

25:11.968 --> 25:13.511
Colleagues can share a meal, you know.

25:14.930 --> 25:15.805
So should I?

25:15.889 --> 25:18.058
I mean, should I tell her to go?

25:18.141 --> 25:20.352
Yeah. If you make a big deal out of it

25:20.435 --> 25:22.771
and say, "I can't. I like someone else,"

25:22.854 --> 25:24.147
you'll be so embarrassed later.

25:24.231 --> 25:25.941
So just go and have dinner.

25:26.024 --> 25:28.568
And in case it turns out they do like her,

25:28.652 --> 25:31.196
she can tell them then
that she likes someone else.

25:32.447 --> 25:33.657
Really?

25:33.740 --> 25:36.034
You guys watch way too much TV.

25:36.826 --> 25:39.996
Having someone like us,
having a crush on someone,

25:40.080 --> 25:41.957
or confessing your feelings

25:42.040 --> 25:43.333
aren't that easy to do.

25:43.416 --> 25:44.584
It's actually very hard.

25:47.837 --> 25:49.547
What's suddenly gotten into you?

25:49.631 --> 25:52.133
Do you have a blind date
at 6:00 a.m. or something?

25:52.968 --> 25:55.220
No, but someone's buying me a meal.

25:55.845 --> 25:56.721
Who?

25:58.890 --> 25:59.891
My first love.

26:01.768 --> 26:03.478
Today? Out of the blue?

26:03.561 --> 26:04.437
Where?

26:05.772 --> 26:06.898
-Who is it?
-Who is it?

26:06.982 --> 26:08.066
My tutor from high school.

26:08.566 --> 26:09.818
I was totally in love with her.

26:10.610 --> 26:12.279
I went to med school because of her.

26:12.362 --> 26:13.196
She's a doctor?

26:14.239 --> 26:15.073
At our hospital?

26:15.156 --> 26:16.074
No.

26:16.783 --> 26:19.160
It would've been so nice if she was.

26:19.244 --> 26:21.037
I even confessed my feelings then.

26:21.121 --> 26:23.748
But she said I'd find
tons of people like her at college,

26:23.832 --> 26:25.417
so I should study hard instead.

26:25.500 --> 26:26.584
But there weren't any.

26:27.711 --> 26:28.920
What kind of person is she?

26:32.257 --> 26:33.466
She's amazing.

26:34.551 --> 26:36.803
The way she talks
and her facial expressions

26:36.886 --> 26:38.471
can seem very cold and curt, but…

26:39.556 --> 26:40.849
She's so lovely when she smiles.

26:41.641 --> 26:42.976
And her favorite things

26:43.059 --> 26:45.312
are studying and spicy tteokbokki.

26:47.147 --> 26:48.148
Isn't that adorable?

26:51.484 --> 26:53.611
I know someone like that.

26:53.695 --> 26:54.696
Me too.

26:56.865 --> 26:58.908
-That's Kim Sa-bi.
-Yeah!

26:59.701 --> 27:01.328
-Hey!
-Hey!

27:01.411 --> 27:02.954
You guys are so slow!

27:03.038 --> 27:05.248
When are you going to do
the handovers and pre-rounds?

27:05.915 --> 27:08.043
Hey, how dare you?

27:08.126 --> 27:09.461
She's worlds apart from her.

27:12.589 --> 27:14.174
Don't be ridiculous.

27:16.926 --> 27:18.511
What's with him? Where's he going?

27:19.721 --> 27:20.847
To meet his first love.

27:22.557 --> 27:23.433
Hello?

27:24.267 --> 27:25.185
The hospital?

27:26.644 --> 27:27.854
You're doing what?

27:27.937 --> 27:29.314
Wait, hold on.

27:30.106 --> 27:30.940
Okay.

27:31.566 --> 27:33.234
-What is it?
-Hong Gi-dong?

27:37.864 --> 27:38.698
Ms…

27:40.658 --> 27:41.534
Hey!

27:58.510 --> 27:59.677
What brings you here?

27:59.761 --> 28:02.013
Did you come here on purpose
to have a meal with me?

28:02.764 --> 28:03.640
No.

28:04.641 --> 28:07.519
I came to see a professor
for my PhD dissertation progress report.

28:08.978 --> 28:10.855
I came a bit early.

28:10.939 --> 28:13.191
And I remembered
you always asked to meet up.

28:13.274 --> 28:15.485
So you did think of me.

28:15.568 --> 28:18.571
Yeah. We always talked about
meeting up but didn't.

28:19.447 --> 28:20.448
Right.

28:20.532 --> 28:21.491
How have you been?

28:22.242 --> 28:23.451
How's your residency going?

28:23.535 --> 28:24.744
It's hard, right?

28:24.828 --> 28:26.746
Yes, it's so hard.

28:27.247 --> 28:29.290
How did you do this
for four years, Gyeo-ul?

28:30.375 --> 28:31.584
Ms. Jang.

28:32.460 --> 28:35.338
Not Gyeo-ul. It's Ms. Jang.

28:37.006 --> 28:39.426
Okay. Ms. Jang.

28:41.428 --> 28:44.055
It seemed like yesterday
you were whining about falling grades.

28:44.139 --> 28:46.766
But it is cool seeing you in a lab coat.

28:48.685 --> 28:49.978
It's all thanks to you.

28:50.061 --> 28:51.438
After HI-BOYZ disbanded,

28:51.521 --> 28:53.815
I studied with you for two years
and got into med school.

28:54.524 --> 28:56.735
If it weren't for you,
I wouldn't have become a doctor.

28:58.236 --> 28:59.070
Me too.

29:00.572 --> 29:02.323
If it weren't for the pay
from tutoring you,

29:02.407 --> 29:03.908
I wouldn't have graduated.

29:09.205 --> 29:10.039
But…

29:11.750 --> 29:13.835
do you remember that you were

29:14.502 --> 29:15.545
my first love?

29:15.628 --> 29:16.713
I was?

29:16.796 --> 29:18.381
No, I don't remember.

29:19.048 --> 29:20.300
That was so long ago.

29:20.383 --> 29:21.634
More than ten years.

29:23.887 --> 29:26.139
Why aren't you eating?
You always asked me to treat you.

29:30.143 --> 29:31.978
This isn't what I wanted.

29:33.480 --> 29:35.023
Take me out to another meal next time.

29:35.607 --> 29:36.858
Not in these scrubs,

29:36.941 --> 29:38.193
but in our personal clothes.

29:45.533 --> 29:46.367
Well,

29:47.118 --> 29:49.287
just go get changed and you can eat then.

29:49.370 --> 29:50.789
You're playing dumb, aren't you?

29:51.748 --> 29:53.291
-Right?
-Yeah.

29:53.792 --> 29:54.709
Was it obvious?

29:55.710 --> 29:57.253
I usually have a good poker face.

30:00.548 --> 30:02.383
PEDIATRICS
AHN JEONG-WON

30:04.928 --> 30:05.762
Just a second.

30:07.889 --> 30:08.723
Hi.

30:09.849 --> 30:10.683
Not yet.

30:11.267 --> 30:13.061
I'm meeting with someone.

30:13.978 --> 30:15.814
My surgery's at 4:00 p.m. today,
so it's fine.

30:17.398 --> 30:18.733
I'll be there as soon as I can.

30:19.776 --> 30:20.652
Okay, bye.

30:23.238 --> 30:24.155
Do you have to go?

30:24.239 --> 30:25.240
No.

30:25.323 --> 30:26.825
Did something happen at the hospital?

30:26.908 --> 30:28.701
It wasn't the hospital.
It was my boyfriend.

30:29.536 --> 30:32.038
We're having lunch later,
so he asked when I was coming.

30:32.121 --> 30:32.956
Wait…

30:33.748 --> 30:35.166
Who's your boyfriend?

30:35.750 --> 30:37.001
You don't know him.

30:37.085 --> 30:38.127
Since when?

30:39.003 --> 30:39.838
It's been a while.

30:41.339 --> 30:42.632
Why are you telling me this now?

30:42.715 --> 30:45.260
Why do I need to tell you?

30:45.343 --> 30:46.344
Geez…

30:47.095 --> 30:48.263
Then why…

30:49.597 --> 30:51.641
Why are you taking me out for a meal?

30:54.853 --> 30:55.728
Bread.

30:56.896 --> 30:58.356
I bought you some bread.

30:58.439 --> 30:59.607
Damn it.

31:03.570 --> 31:04.404
Goodness.

31:04.904 --> 31:06.322
When will you grow up?

31:20.920 --> 31:22.589
How did meeting your first love go?

31:23.256 --> 31:24.173
Fine.

31:24.257 --> 31:25.967
I saw her off.

31:26.050 --> 31:26.885
Why did she come?

31:27.635 --> 31:28.469
For her PhD…

31:29.804 --> 31:32.599
Hey. Go rest, will you?

31:32.682 --> 31:33.516
Doesn't it hurt?

31:34.183 --> 31:35.935
It does. It still hurts.

31:40.648 --> 31:42.609
Then why are you
going around looking for work?

31:43.318 --> 31:45.069
I can't stay in bed anymore.

31:47.071 --> 31:48.072
Okay, work then.

31:48.615 --> 31:49.616
You can work,

31:50.533 --> 31:52.952
but please don't tell the patients
that surgery hurts.

31:53.036 --> 31:54.120
They'll get scared.

31:54.871 --> 31:56.039
But it's the truth.

31:56.706 --> 31:57.707
I can't lie.

31:57.790 --> 31:58.708
Geez.

31:59.626 --> 32:01.628
I now know
we've been explaining things wrong.

32:01.711 --> 32:04.339
Who said laparoscopic surgery
doesn't hurt? It hurts like hell.

32:04.422 --> 32:06.007
And it's not simple at all.

32:06.090 --> 32:08.092
There's surgery, anesthesia,
and hospitalization.

32:08.635 --> 32:09.552
And you.

32:09.636 --> 32:11.471
Stop nagging us for urine samples.

32:11.554 --> 32:13.139
We don't like using Nelaton catheters.

32:15.016 --> 32:16.726
I guess you only know
if you go through it.

32:16.809 --> 32:18.186
Do you get it now?

32:18.269 --> 32:19.228
What?

32:19.312 --> 32:20.396
You mean the patients?

32:20.480 --> 32:21.314
No.

32:22.023 --> 32:23.399
How itchy unwashed hair is.

32:24.442 --> 32:26.027
I've never seen you with unwashed hair.

32:29.072 --> 32:31.699
That familiar smell.
Is it the smell of humanity?

32:31.783 --> 32:32.700
It's not me!

32:33.451 --> 32:34.327
Of course it is.

32:39.123 --> 32:41.250
Hey, that's my room. No one's in there.

32:41.334 --> 32:42.585
YOON
ATTENDING DOCTOR: KI EUN-MI

32:43.461 --> 32:44.921
KIM
ATTENDING DOCTOR: UM JAE-IL

32:45.004 --> 32:47.173
As I told you during outpatient care,

32:47.256 --> 32:49.258
the cyst found on the ovary

32:49.842 --> 32:53.304
appears benign
based on its size and shape.

32:53.388 --> 32:54.973
And on the ultrasound,

32:55.598 --> 32:57.183
it looks like a simple cyst,

32:57.266 --> 32:59.686
so there's no need for any major concern.

33:00.561 --> 33:02.397
But even so,

33:02.480 --> 33:05.149
the ovaries have to be removed?

33:05.733 --> 33:08.277
Yes, since you've already
gone through menopause,

33:08.361 --> 33:10.405
the ovaries and fallopian tubes

33:11.030 --> 33:12.532
no longer function at all.

33:12.615 --> 33:14.784
So, it'll be better to remove them now

33:15.660 --> 33:20.248
to lower the risk of any future diseases.

33:21.374 --> 33:22.291
I see.

33:22.375 --> 33:24.460
It's actually quicker and simpler to do

33:24.544 --> 33:27.046
than to remove just the cyst alone.

33:27.672 --> 33:28.673
You don't have to worry.

33:29.507 --> 33:31.509
Well, this is such a nice hospital

33:32.051 --> 33:34.387
with such wonderful doctors,

33:34.470 --> 33:35.805
so I'm sure it'll go well.

33:38.349 --> 33:39.225
Oh, my.

33:41.060 --> 33:42.770
You're the mother of our resident?

33:44.564 --> 33:47.025
Hey, what happened?
Why didn't you tell us?

33:48.276 --> 33:49.110
Well…

33:49.193 --> 33:50.903
I just found out too.

33:50.987 --> 33:51.988
I'm sorry, Professor.

33:52.071 --> 33:53.031
No need to be sorry.

33:53.114 --> 33:55.825
Don't be. Ma'am, you should've told us.

33:55.908 --> 33:57.535
You didn't say
at outpatient care either.

33:58.286 --> 34:00.997
I didn't want to worry her
when she's busy.

34:01.873 --> 34:03.249
I didn't want to be a bother,

34:03.332 --> 34:05.168
and I wasn't going to come,

34:05.251 --> 34:08.838
but still, it's nice to get surgery
at your daughter's hospital.

34:09.422 --> 34:11.049
And you get a discount too!

34:11.883 --> 34:13.760
-Welcome, ma'am.
-Thank you.

34:13.843 --> 34:15.094
We're very glad you're here.

34:15.178 --> 34:16.012
-Thank you.
-We are.

34:16.804 --> 34:17.930
You did very well.

34:18.014 --> 34:19.891
Please take care of my Nam-kyung.

34:19.974 --> 34:20.975
Don't.

34:21.059 --> 34:24.604
At home, her dad spoils her so much
like a princess.

34:26.147 --> 34:29.400
So I don't know if she can
take care of herself in the real world.

34:32.987 --> 34:35.948
Anyways, please be gentle with her.

34:36.032 --> 34:38.451
Princess, we'll take good care of you.

34:42.830 --> 34:44.624
What? Come on.

34:47.001 --> 34:48.044
Princess Pyo.

34:51.589 --> 34:53.091
Is everything okay?

34:55.593 --> 34:56.761
Yes, there's no bleeding,

34:57.386 --> 34:59.847
and the baby's fine. Don't worry.

35:00.681 --> 35:01.849
What a relief.

35:02.809 --> 35:03.935
By the way, Doctor,

35:04.018 --> 35:06.729
I haven't slept at all these days.

35:06.813 --> 35:09.440
I wake up every hour.

35:09.524 --> 35:10.900
Is there any way to fix that?

35:11.984 --> 35:14.904
We're limited on what medications
we can use during pregnancy.

35:14.987 --> 35:16.697
We can't give you sleeping pills.

35:16.781 --> 35:18.533
I know that too.

35:18.616 --> 35:21.619
But being unable to sleep
can't be good for the baby.

35:22.328 --> 35:24.413
Is there another way besides drugs?

35:25.498 --> 35:28.793
Instead of lying in bed during the day,

35:28.876 --> 35:30.461
if you move around a bit--

35:30.545 --> 35:32.964
What if that induces uterine contractions?

35:33.589 --> 35:36.425
Moving around won't induce contractions.

35:37.635 --> 35:39.095
Are you sure this time?

35:39.762 --> 35:41.097
Yes, I am.

35:42.431 --> 35:45.893
I don't know how to help you sleep…

35:48.020 --> 35:48.896
I mean,

35:49.522 --> 35:51.357
let me ask the professor.

35:52.024 --> 35:54.443
With placenta previa and bleeding,

35:54.527 --> 35:56.529
it's no surprise you can't sleep.

35:56.612 --> 36:00.616
It's because your head
is filled with a lot

36:00.700 --> 36:02.910
of thoughts, worries, and concerns.

36:04.912 --> 36:08.291
There's a sleeping pill I use
for when that happens.

36:08.374 --> 36:09.709
She can't.

36:09.792 --> 36:11.627
Taking unprescribed meds
would be dangerous.

36:16.299 --> 36:19.093
When you have a lot on your mind,
you need to be active.

36:19.177 --> 36:20.928
But we're scared of that too.

36:21.012 --> 36:24.599
So we try to keep
at least our fingers busy.

36:25.391 --> 36:27.476
I've already made 500 cranes.

36:33.191 --> 36:35.151
Does folding cranes
really make you fall asleep?

36:35.234 --> 36:36.611
Of course.

36:36.694 --> 36:38.112
I'm living proof.

36:38.696 --> 36:40.573
The clinical trial's over.

36:41.240 --> 36:42.700
Thank you.

36:42.783 --> 36:44.869
But if you still can't sleep, tell me.

36:44.952 --> 36:46.704
I have another way too.

36:59.967 --> 37:01.093
Excuse me, ma'am!

37:01.177 --> 37:02.595
I mean, Ms. Ji.

37:03.554 --> 37:05.514
I need a solution
before the professor comes,

37:05.598 --> 37:07.767
but I have no one to ask and no time.

37:07.850 --> 37:08.976
I'm in a bit of a hurry.

37:11.771 --> 37:13.189
It's about Ms. Lee.

37:14.440 --> 37:15.691
She has bad constipation,

37:16.192 --> 37:17.777
but doesn't want to take laxatives.

37:18.402 --> 37:20.238
Right, constipation.

37:20.988 --> 37:22.073
For that,

37:27.745 --> 37:31.207
I did my research on this place,
so it's trustworthy.

37:31.290 --> 37:33.960
They deliver orders
to the hospital lobby too.

37:34.043 --> 37:35.878
Tell her to try this first.

37:37.088 --> 37:38.089
Thank you.

37:41.968 --> 37:44.345
But I'm wondering…

37:46.764 --> 37:49.100
if it's okay for me to drink as well?

37:50.726 --> 37:52.687
Trust me.

37:54.188 --> 37:55.022
I do.

38:00.278 --> 38:02.697
Everyone, I just learned
something amazing.

38:03.322 --> 38:05.074
This will work right away.

38:05.157 --> 38:07.118
I need it too, so how about a group order?

38:07.201 --> 38:09.036
JONGNO YULJE MEDICAL CENTER

38:09.120 --> 38:10.830
You came for outpatient care in secret,

38:10.913 --> 38:12.999
and you didn't tell me
you booked your surgery.

38:13.958 --> 38:15.293
I didn't want you to worry.

38:15.376 --> 38:17.211
Then you should've kept it
completely secret.

38:17.295 --> 38:19.797
I work here. How could I not find out?

38:19.880 --> 38:22.967
Okay, I said I was sorry.

38:25.136 --> 38:28.180
Mom, your surgery's tomorrow,
so you have to fast starting at midnight.

38:28.264 --> 38:31.142
Yeah, they already
explained everything earlier.

38:31.225 --> 38:32.977
If you eat anything,
they'll cancel surgery.

38:33.060 --> 38:36.147
That'll inconvenience all the doctors,
nurses, and anesthesiologists.

38:36.230 --> 38:37.481
I said I got it.

38:37.565 --> 38:38.441
Mom.

38:38.524 --> 38:42.069
Don't bother the nurses either, okay?

38:42.153 --> 38:44.488
And don't say anything to the professors.

38:44.572 --> 38:46.824
What on earth would I ever say?

38:46.907 --> 38:49.368
Mom, don't even ask questions.
Just ask me.

38:49.452 --> 38:52.663
And, Mom, please don't talk about me here!

38:52.747 --> 38:54.415
It's my place of work!

38:54.498 --> 38:55.416
All right, already.

38:55.499 --> 38:57.710
How many times
do you have to say the same…

38:59.628 --> 39:01.839
Hey, did you eat yet? What did you eat?

39:02.423 --> 39:03.341
Just some bread.

39:03.424 --> 39:04.425
Why only bread?

39:04.508 --> 39:05.843
I don't have time.

39:05.926 --> 39:07.428
You should have a proper meal.

39:07.511 --> 39:10.765
They say young people these days have
weak immune systems since they don't eat.

39:10.848 --> 39:12.141
I saw it on Dongchimi.

39:12.224 --> 39:13.476
Okay.

39:13.559 --> 39:16.020
Hey, take some dumplings
while you're here.

39:16.103 --> 39:18.356
I brought a lot for you to share.

39:18.439 --> 39:20.316
Mom, not now.

39:20.399 --> 39:23.986
You know, you have to line up
for our dumplings these days.

39:24.070 --> 39:25.071
These are a delicacy.

39:25.154 --> 39:28.240
Mom, they don't like dumplings here.

39:30.576 --> 39:32.161
Oh, no. I really have to go.

39:32.244 --> 39:33.829
-Just eat one before you go.
-Mom, stop.

39:33.913 --> 39:35.956
I mean, just take one in your mouth.

39:36.040 --> 39:36.874
Mom!

39:36.957 --> 39:38.376
I said I don't want it!

39:38.459 --> 39:41.379
I'm busy! I'm working right now!

39:43.839 --> 39:46.175
Gosh, that temper of yours.

39:47.843 --> 39:49.345
That temper.

39:49.887 --> 39:52.056
I told you I didn't want it.

39:52.139 --> 39:53.349
All right!

39:58.396 --> 40:00.773
You'll come later after work, right?

40:02.817 --> 40:03.651
Yeah.

40:04.235 --> 40:06.278
What time? When?

40:06.362 --> 40:09.198
Are you going to eat first?
Do you want me to steam these and wait?

40:09.740 --> 40:10.616
I don't know.

40:10.699 --> 40:12.701
-I have to go.
-Okay, go.

40:12.785 --> 40:13.744
-Mom.
-What?

40:13.828 --> 40:15.162
Please don't talk about me, okay?

40:15.246 --> 40:17.581
-I won't.
-Seriously, don't.

40:17.665 --> 40:19.083
-I'm going.
-Go.

40:29.218 --> 40:31.679
Your father's coming
for Chuseok this year.

40:31.762 --> 40:32.888
He called this afternoon.

40:33.764 --> 40:34.807
-He is?
-Yeah.

40:34.890 --> 40:37.560
He said it'd be hard on you
and your sister to visit him.

40:39.228 --> 40:40.146
Well, I don't mind.

40:42.148 --> 40:43.357
You didn't tell him, right?

40:44.150 --> 40:44.984
About what?

40:47.736 --> 40:49.196
About my infertility treatment.

40:49.280 --> 40:51.240
You didn't tell him
I'm doing it again, right?

40:51.824 --> 40:53.826
I didn't. Don't worry.

40:54.785 --> 40:56.454
For what? It'd obviously just upset him.

40:57.830 --> 40:59.623
-Good job.
-Yeah.

41:00.249 --> 41:02.918
By the way, why did you cry
in your sleep last night?

41:07.339 --> 41:10.176
I dreamed about that day again.

41:11.469 --> 41:13.262
The day you cried the most in your life?

41:13.345 --> 41:14.180
Yeah.

41:16.932 --> 41:18.851
This time, I was crying in my dream,

41:20.686 --> 41:23.481
but my throat closed up,
and I really couldn't breathe.

41:24.815 --> 41:27.067
I couldn't even scream
and woke up flailing.

41:28.903 --> 41:29.820
You remember that day?

41:30.905 --> 41:31.864
Of course.

41:32.448 --> 41:34.533
I saw your sister cry
for the first time then.

41:36.285 --> 41:37.119
Yi-young?

41:37.203 --> 41:38.704
Yeah, in front of the bathroom.

41:40.915 --> 41:43.542
She scolded me for crying so much.

41:43.626 --> 41:45.211
I can't believe her.

42:06.232 --> 42:09.068
One shot please, Doctor.

42:09.151 --> 42:11.070
FOLLITROPIN

42:14.823 --> 42:16.242
Here we go again.

42:17.660 --> 42:18.661
Yeah.

42:21.247 --> 42:23.249
I really hope this will be the last time.

42:24.833 --> 42:25.751
Please.

42:26.961 --> 42:29.296
Ms. Oh, please take a seat here.

42:29.380 --> 42:30.297
Okay.

42:32.883 --> 42:34.927
I'll make sure it doesn't hurt.

42:36.136 --> 42:36.971
Okay.

42:39.014 --> 42:40.683
We'll disinfect first.

42:40.766 --> 42:41.767
Okay.

42:42.518 --> 42:43.894
JONGNO YULJE MEDICAL CENTER

42:45.312 --> 42:46.397
Nam-kyung did?

42:46.480 --> 42:47.314
Yeah.

42:47.940 --> 42:49.108
In middle school,

42:49.191 --> 42:53.070
she studied all the time
and didn't really hang out with friends.

42:54.071 --> 42:57.575
During field trips and field days,
she was always alone.

42:58.367 --> 43:00.369
But am I talking too much about her?

43:00.452 --> 43:02.329
No, it's so interesting.

43:02.871 --> 43:04.873
It's totally different
from the Nam-kyung I know.

43:06.959 --> 43:08.502
Well, the thing is

43:09.587 --> 43:12.506
she brightened up a bit after college.

43:12.590 --> 43:14.967
According to her, after the surgery,

43:15.050 --> 43:16.844
her personality changed or whatever.

43:16.927 --> 43:18.220
Surgery?

43:19.555 --> 43:20.848
-Her nose--
-Fillers!

43:20.931 --> 43:22.808
It wasn't surgery! They were fillers!

43:22.891 --> 43:25.436
Mom, stop and just go to sleep!

43:25.519 --> 43:26.895
Goodness, you scared me!

43:26.979 --> 43:28.981
Gosh, instead of your nose,

43:29.064 --> 43:31.442
they should've fixed your temper.

43:31.525 --> 43:34.111
How many times
do I have to tell you they were fillers?

43:34.194 --> 43:36.280
Gosh, who'd put up
with that kind of temper?

43:36.363 --> 43:38.574
That's why she's never dated
and is always alone.

43:38.657 --> 43:39.658
What?

43:39.742 --> 43:42.953
Others have boyfriends
and go on blind dates, but she doesn't.

43:43.037 --> 43:45.080
Who knows if she'll ever get married?

43:46.624 --> 43:47.708
That's not true.

43:47.791 --> 43:49.835
-She had a guy named Gi-dong--
-Hey, Sa-bi!

43:50.669 --> 43:53.714
You need to sleep now
so you can heal faster.

43:53.797 --> 43:55.466
You said you wanted to get back to work.

43:57.718 --> 43:58.552
Sleep.

44:06.060 --> 44:07.645
But I think

44:08.729 --> 44:09.980
I'm pretty lucky.

44:11.482 --> 44:14.526
All of my daughter's friends
are doctors and nurses.

44:15.861 --> 44:18.822
Even my hospital roommate is her friend.

44:23.327 --> 44:25.579
I told you to just go home and sleep.

44:26.205 --> 44:27.956
Why sleep here?

44:28.540 --> 44:30.084
Because it's a hassle.

44:30.167 --> 44:32.503
But you said your lounge has beds.

44:32.586 --> 44:33.629
Whatever.

44:33.712 --> 44:36.090
Mom, I'm going to sleep now.
You should sleep too.

44:44.848 --> 44:46.016
By the way…

44:48.519 --> 44:50.187
my surgery tomorrow

44:50.270 --> 44:52.272
really is minor, right?

44:52.356 --> 44:54.525
There are no minor surgeries.

44:54.608 --> 44:56.193
Gosh, that startled me.

44:58.779 --> 45:01.698
If it was serious,
would I be here right now?

45:01.782 --> 45:03.117
You think I'd be able to sleep?

45:09.164 --> 45:12.209
You won't be in the operating room

45:12.292 --> 45:13.669
for my surgery, right?

45:13.752 --> 45:14.962
I can't.

45:15.546 --> 45:17.131
I have another surgery.

45:17.881 --> 45:20.717
You didn't tell me,
so I had no time to change my schedule.

45:20.801 --> 45:23.053
Good. Don't come.

45:23.137 --> 45:25.556
I'm still going with you to the OR.

45:25.639 --> 45:26.473
Don't worry.

45:27.641 --> 45:28.892
I won't.

45:30.644 --> 45:32.729
Mom, I'm so sleepy.

45:33.814 --> 45:35.858
You should go to sleep too.

45:35.941 --> 45:37.359
Sleep, sleep.

45:40.821 --> 45:42.072
Good night.

45:45.075 --> 45:46.326
Good night.

46:06.680 --> 46:07.514
What's with him?

46:10.142 --> 46:11.185
Hey!

46:11.727 --> 46:13.562
Have you been possessed
by a workaholic ghost?

46:13.645 --> 46:14.771
Go away!

46:14.855 --> 46:17.357
Everyone's busy.
The least I can do is not be a burden.

46:18.233 --> 46:19.067
Geez.

46:19.985 --> 46:22.946
It's my third POD,
and I'm still being prescribed mucolytics.

46:23.030 --> 46:24.531
I think we can discontinue that.

46:24.615 --> 46:26.241
Let's just discharge you now.

46:26.325 --> 46:28.869
I'd like to, but Prof. Jo said no.

46:28.952 --> 46:30.454
Isn't Dr. Ryu your doctor?

46:30.537 --> 46:31.622
He is.

46:31.705 --> 46:35.292
But Prof. Jo said my hemoglobin levels
were still low so I should rest more.

46:35.375 --> 46:36.460
He saw your chart?

46:38.378 --> 46:39.213
That's a surprise.

46:40.797 --> 46:42.299
I don't know. Maybe he's bored.

46:45.052 --> 46:46.136
Oh, right!

46:47.095 --> 46:48.472
For Ms. Kim Seon-yu,

46:48.555 --> 46:51.475
it seems we'll have to remove
more of her bowel than expected.

46:51.558 --> 46:53.060
-Ms. Kim Seon-yu?
-Yeah.

46:57.814 --> 46:59.358
We're consulting with General Surgery.

47:00.025 --> 47:01.693
She needs surgery and cancer treatment.

47:01.777 --> 47:03.529
How many days has she been on TPN for?

47:05.322 --> 47:06.365
Damn it.

47:13.372 --> 47:16.166
You should take it easy
and rest even at home.

47:17.084 --> 47:20.087
If there's vaginal bleeding again,
come straight to the delivery room.

47:20.170 --> 47:21.547
Yes, I will.

47:21.630 --> 47:23.423
Your due in two months, right?

47:24.841 --> 47:27.469
Let me know when the baby comes.

47:28.637 --> 47:30.180
Me too.

47:30.264 --> 47:31.431
And send some photos.

47:33.809 --> 47:36.353
In that case,
since you know all our numbers,

47:36.436 --> 47:38.146
make a group chat and let us know.

47:39.398 --> 47:41.233
Gosh, I'm jealous.

47:41.316 --> 47:43.610
All I want is to be able to go home too.

47:43.694 --> 47:44.861
You will too.

47:51.868 --> 47:53.495
How can you eat more of those?

47:53.579 --> 47:55.706
You ate a bunch in your ward earlier.

47:55.789 --> 47:57.791
Yeah, I had some
at the nurses' station too.

47:57.874 --> 47:59.543
The GYN ward's having a dumpling party.

47:59.626 --> 48:00.752
The OB ward too.

48:01.336 --> 48:04.298
Wherever the dumplings went got a ton
of fun facts about Nam-kyung too.

48:04.381 --> 48:05.424
Princess Pyo.

48:06.758 --> 48:08.969
I told Mom not to talk about me.

48:09.052 --> 48:11.096
It turns out their dumpling place
is super famous.

48:11.179 --> 48:12.764
It's a popular spot in that area.

48:13.432 --> 48:15.100
I'm so jealous of you, Nam-kyung.

48:15.183 --> 48:16.893
You get to eat dumplings and see your mom.

48:16.977 --> 48:17.811
What?

48:18.353 --> 48:20.188
My parents live abroad.

48:20.272 --> 48:22.024
They run a laundromat in the US.

48:22.816 --> 48:23.650
How did you know?

48:23.734 --> 48:25.319
If you search "Um Jay,"
it's all online.

48:26.445 --> 48:27.446
Impressive.

48:33.660 --> 48:34.745
Hey, Sa-bi.

48:34.828 --> 48:37.497
Mom wants to know your address
so she can send you steamed buns.

48:37.581 --> 48:38.874
Really? When? A lot?

48:38.957 --> 48:40.208
-What about me?
-Me too!

48:43.337 --> 48:45.505
But why steamed buns and not dumplings?

48:45.589 --> 48:47.007
She asked me what I like.

48:47.090 --> 48:48.425
And I said I like red beans.

48:49.509 --> 48:50.927
I just said it in passing.

48:51.011 --> 48:52.262
But she has a great memory.

48:52.346 --> 48:53.388
My mom?

48:53.472 --> 48:54.473
Yeah.

48:54.556 --> 48:57.142
The lunches she packed
for your elementary school field trips.

48:57.225 --> 48:59.269
Flowers she bought
for your high school graduation.

48:59.353 --> 49:00.354
She remembers it all.

49:02.022 --> 49:04.149
My mom never came
to any of my graduations.

49:04.232 --> 49:05.067
It made me jealous.

49:05.734 --> 49:06.943
What's there to be jealous of?

49:07.027 --> 49:08.779
Your mom's a big-shot doctor.
That's great.

49:08.862 --> 49:11.031
-What's great about that?
-What's not great about that?

49:11.114 --> 49:12.699
At least your moms are in the country.

49:12.783 --> 49:14.701
Geez, you're all are so immature.

49:15.702 --> 49:16.745
At least you have moms.

49:18.705 --> 49:20.874
Isn't that enough? You're so greedy.

49:30.092 --> 49:31.426
I should get going. Bye!

49:31.510 --> 49:32.928
-Good luck!
-Thanks.

49:39.434 --> 49:40.435
BEWARE OF FALLING

49:40.519 --> 49:43.522
Our professor's famous
for being a good surgeon.

49:44.106 --> 49:46.066
He could do yours with his eyes closed.

49:47.442 --> 49:48.527
I know.

49:49.361 --> 49:51.780
But you said you had surgery.
Don't you have to go?

49:51.863 --> 49:54.574
After I see you go in, I have to go.

49:56.952 --> 49:58.203
You can do this, right?

49:59.454 --> 50:02.124
I won't be doing anything.
The doctors will.

50:02.916 --> 50:04.334
It'll be over in an hour.

50:04.918 --> 50:07.129
Just think of it as taking a nice nap.

50:07.212 --> 50:08.046
Okay.

50:09.214 --> 50:10.132
Goodness.

50:14.886 --> 50:16.096
-Mom.
-Yeah?

50:16.179 --> 50:17.681
-I'll see you later.
-Okay.

50:23.562 --> 50:24.563
We'll go in now.

50:25.272 --> 50:26.690
Please take good care of her.

50:26.773 --> 50:27.941
Don't worry.

50:29.025 --> 50:30.193
We'll take you in now.

50:33.321 --> 50:34.197
I can do it!

50:34.823 --> 50:35.657
I can do it.

50:54.259 --> 50:55.427
Excuse me, Doctor.

50:55.510 --> 50:56.762
Please take good care of her.

50:56.845 --> 50:57.929
She's my mom.

50:58.013 --> 50:59.765
Yes, I heard.

50:59.848 --> 51:02.017
It's a simple procedure, so…

51:02.642 --> 51:04.144
Well, you already know.

51:04.227 --> 51:05.103
Yes.

51:05.187 --> 51:06.354
Doctor.

51:06.438 --> 51:09.900
My mom really can't stand the cold.

51:09.983 --> 51:11.818
When the surgery's over,

51:12.444 --> 51:14.654
could you put a few more blankets on her?

51:14.738 --> 51:15.989
Yes, I will.

51:16.072 --> 51:17.574
Thank you.

51:23.747 --> 51:25.123
-Mommy!
-Mommy!

51:25.207 --> 51:26.416
Hi, San and Deul!

51:28.710 --> 51:30.545
Are you back from preschool?

51:31.379 --> 51:32.464
Did you eat?

51:32.547 --> 51:34.758
Yes, we did!

51:34.841 --> 51:39.054
I'm really going to come home soon now.

51:39.596 --> 51:40.639
When?

51:41.431 --> 51:42.682
Well,

51:42.766 --> 51:46.102
after two more sleeps, I'll be home.

51:46.186 --> 51:47.646
Really?

51:47.729 --> 51:50.482
I was supposed to go after ten sleeps,

51:51.107 --> 51:53.860
but I missed you both so much,
so I'm coming sooner.

51:54.444 --> 51:55.445
And the baby?

51:56.238 --> 51:57.405
And the baby?

52:00.325 --> 52:01.576
Let me ask

52:02.452 --> 52:05.038
if the baby

52:05.121 --> 52:06.456
can come with me.

52:06.540 --> 52:07.624
Okay.

52:08.250 --> 52:09.793
Watch some TV and play.

52:10.669 --> 52:11.837
I love you.

52:13.463 --> 52:16.049
-I love you.
-I love you.

52:49.958 --> 52:53.336
The routine NST
didn't show any issues this morning.

52:54.129 --> 52:56.381
But she said just a bit ago
the baby wasn't moving well.

52:57.215 --> 52:59.134
So we did another NST,

52:59.217 --> 53:00.635
and we couldn't get a heartbeat.

53:02.387 --> 53:03.471
We did an ultrasonography,

53:04.306 --> 53:06.391
and it seems to be an IUFD.

53:09.853 --> 53:10.896
Any other symptoms?

53:12.147 --> 53:14.983
The lab results were fine
with no other symptoms of note.

53:18.778 --> 53:21.281
So what do we do now?

53:21.364 --> 53:24.868
I'll move her to tomorrow's first surgery
and tell her guardian to come.

53:24.951 --> 53:27.829
Right. Then…

53:27.913 --> 53:29.331
What do I do now?

53:30.040 --> 53:31.207
What?

53:32.792 --> 53:34.294
I don't know if there's a point

53:34.961 --> 53:37.589
in giving a medical explanation.

53:38.506 --> 53:40.342
And when I think about it as a fellow mom,

53:41.259 --> 53:42.928
it makes it even harder to talk about.

53:44.304 --> 53:46.014
If I tell her I have no words,

53:46.723 --> 53:48.141
that would be meaningless.

53:49.726 --> 53:51.478
I don't know what to say to her.

54:19.839 --> 54:21.299
To explain the procedure…

54:21.383 --> 54:23.134
I'll do it. Just prepare the consent form.

54:23.218 --> 54:24.052
No.

54:26.846 --> 54:27.847
I will do it.

54:43.863 --> 54:45.699
The abdomen was clean with no adhesions.

54:45.782 --> 54:48.243
The cyst looked completely benign
even to the naked eye.

54:48.326 --> 54:49.577
That's a relief.

54:50.203 --> 54:51.997
They were done in twenty minutes,

54:52.080 --> 54:53.123
so she should be fine.

54:53.206 --> 54:54.290
Right.

54:57.544 --> 54:59.754
Her belly was stitched up nicely too.

55:00.338 --> 55:01.172
You're right.

55:01.256 --> 55:02.340
Goodness.

55:02.424 --> 55:04.259
I remembered you said
she easily gets cold,

55:04.342 --> 55:06.219
so I put three more blankets
when she came out.

55:06.302 --> 55:07.137
You did?

55:07.971 --> 55:09.639
Hey, you're a patient too, you know.

55:09.723 --> 55:11.266
Right. That's why I know.

55:12.308 --> 55:13.893
You didn't have to do that.

55:16.813 --> 55:19.441
Mom, are you okay? Does it hurt a lot?

55:21.860 --> 55:23.194
It hurts.

55:26.698 --> 55:29.075
Ma'am, it's normal for it to hurt a lot.

55:29.784 --> 55:33.413
You just had surgery, so it'll feel like
your ribs and back are being crushed.

55:34.122 --> 55:36.458
It's going to hurt
for a few more hours.

55:37.375 --> 55:38.626
It won't be okay for a bit.

55:40.962 --> 55:42.505
I'll be her doctor for today.

55:42.589 --> 55:43.631
I'm not busy anyway.

55:44.299 --> 55:45.467
Thanks, Sa-bi.

55:51.890 --> 55:53.767
Mom, I have to go.

55:54.476 --> 55:56.561
If it hurts, don't bear it.

55:56.644 --> 55:57.687
Tell Sa-bi.

55:57.771 --> 55:59.564
She'll give you some painkillers, okay?

56:01.066 --> 56:02.317
Bye. Thanks.

56:03.943 --> 56:05.195
Nam-kyung.

56:06.863 --> 56:08.698
What? What is it, Mom?

56:11.159 --> 56:12.827
Don't eat bread.

56:14.996 --> 56:16.164
Eat a proper meal.

56:20.251 --> 56:22.837
Why would I eat at this hour?

56:23.463 --> 56:25.256
Have a proper meal.

56:25.340 --> 56:27.675
Okay, I will.

56:42.899 --> 56:43.858
You should eat.

56:46.903 --> 56:49.072
It's been a long time since lunch.

57:15.140 --> 57:16.141
Suddenly…

57:18.977 --> 57:20.562
something so unexpected happened.

57:24.190 --> 57:25.608
You've been through a lot.

57:29.779 --> 57:30.613
Doctor.

57:31.990 --> 57:32.866
Yes?

57:41.958 --> 57:43.751
The surgery's in the morning.

57:43.835 --> 57:45.753
You have to fast starting from midnight.

57:45.837 --> 57:48.214
And you can't eat
for six hours after surgery.

57:49.507 --> 57:50.341
Okay.

57:50.842 --> 57:51.843
So…

57:55.263 --> 57:56.764
If you don't eat now,

57:58.766 --> 58:00.602
you'll get hungry later on.

58:07.525 --> 58:08.568
Then…

58:11.821 --> 58:14.741
you'll hate yourself
for being hungry at a time like this

58:15.450 --> 58:17.368
and wonder if you deserve to be a mom.

58:26.002 --> 58:27.337
That's what my sister told me.

58:29.380 --> 58:31.049
She usually doesn't cry much.

58:34.969 --> 58:37.180
But she cried a lot then.

58:38.806 --> 58:40.808
When she woke up the next morning,

58:41.476 --> 58:43.478
she cried because she was hungry.

58:46.773 --> 58:48.983
She was afraid
the baby would be hungry too.

58:51.361 --> 58:52.820
She thought since she didn't eat,

58:53.530 --> 58:56.282
maybe the baby
couldn't eat anything either.

58:57.992 --> 58:59.077
I told her

58:59.160 --> 59:02.622
the baby didn't need food anymore.

59:04.791 --> 59:05.959
But it didn't help.

59:14.759 --> 59:17.679
It's already been more than five years,

59:18.388 --> 59:20.765
but sometimes,
she still dreams about that day.

59:27.897 --> 59:28.856
So,

59:29.566 --> 59:31.442
even if you have to force yourself,
try to eat.

59:33.319 --> 59:34.862
You must be so sad,

59:35.697 --> 59:37.740
so at least you won't have to
think about this.

01:00:51.939 --> 01:00:53.024
That's good.

01:00:53.107 --> 01:00:55.026
It doesn't hurt? Your stomach isn't sore?

01:00:55.109 --> 01:00:57.820
No, they must've done a good job.

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:00.740
Did you take the pain meds?

01:01:00.823 --> 01:01:04.160
Yeah, Dr. Sa-bi was with me
and made sure I took them on time.

01:01:07.205 --> 01:01:08.915
She said you two were the closest.

01:01:08.998 --> 01:01:09.832
What?

01:01:11.584 --> 01:01:12.710
Yeah.

01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:13.878
I guess.

01:01:13.961 --> 01:01:15.546
Were you busy today too?

01:01:15.630 --> 01:01:16.839
Of course.

01:01:17.715 --> 01:01:19.300
I have another surgery to go to later.

01:01:21.636 --> 01:01:22.470
What kind?

01:01:22.553 --> 01:01:23.805
Would you know if I told you?

01:01:27.934 --> 01:01:30.687
I mean, which professor's surgery is it?

01:01:30.770 --> 01:01:32.355
The one I always talk about.

01:01:32.438 --> 01:01:33.439
The Witch?

01:01:33.523 --> 01:01:34.357
No.

01:01:36.901 --> 01:01:39.570
The one who always screams in the OR?

01:01:39.654 --> 01:01:42.073
What was it? It was "Devil" something.

01:01:42.657 --> 01:01:43.991
Kong… what was it?

01:01:44.075 --> 01:01:46.285
Mom, be quiet. Someone will hear you!

01:01:46.369 --> 01:01:47.286
No.

01:01:47.370 --> 01:01:49.831
If I ever run into them here,

01:01:49.914 --> 01:01:51.416
I'll give her a piece of my mind.

01:01:51.499 --> 01:01:52.500
You're allowed to scold.

01:01:52.583 --> 01:01:54.419
But why scream at all of you?

01:01:54.502 --> 01:01:55.962
They must be insane!

01:01:56.045 --> 01:01:57.255
What are you saying?

01:01:57.338 --> 01:01:59.215
You better not, okay?

01:01:59.298 --> 01:02:00.258
Dr. Pyo?

01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:04.637
Hello, Professor.

01:02:04.721 --> 01:02:06.889
Isn't our surgery soon?
What are you doing?

01:02:07.932 --> 01:02:09.058
Nothing, ma'am.

01:02:09.642 --> 01:02:10.560
I was just leaving.

01:02:13.938 --> 01:02:15.815
Hello, Professor.

01:02:18.151 --> 01:02:19.026
I'm…

01:02:21.154 --> 01:02:24.115
Nam-kyung's mother.

01:02:25.950 --> 01:02:27.034
Hello.

01:02:27.577 --> 01:02:29.579
I'm Prof. Kong Gi-sun,

01:02:29.662 --> 01:02:31.706
and I work with Nam-kyung.

01:02:32.623 --> 01:02:33.833
Was your surgery all right?

01:02:33.916 --> 01:02:34.917
Yes.

01:02:38.004 --> 01:02:39.839
Nam-kyung's told me

01:02:41.090 --> 01:02:42.633
all about you.

01:02:47.805 --> 01:02:48.806
Look,

01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:51.434
Professor…

01:02:55.313 --> 01:02:56.606
my Nam-kyung…

01:03:03.780 --> 01:03:06.365
still has a long way to go.

01:03:06.449 --> 01:03:09.535
I did my best to raise her,

01:03:09.619 --> 01:03:12.163
but you might find her difficult at times.

01:03:12.246 --> 01:03:14.791
I'm so worried
she might be inconveniencing

01:03:14.874 --> 01:03:17.168
all the amazing doctors here.

01:03:17.251 --> 01:03:19.086
I'm very sorry.

01:03:19.170 --> 01:03:20.922
Gosh, no.

01:03:21.798 --> 01:03:23.841
Our Dr. Pyo is an amazing doctor.

01:03:26.052 --> 01:03:28.095
Gosh, thank you so much.

01:03:29.263 --> 01:03:32.767
My daughter's doing something meaningful
thanks to her wonderful professor.

01:03:32.850 --> 01:03:34.602
Please take good care of her.

01:03:34.685 --> 01:03:35.520
Gosh.

01:03:36.312 --> 01:03:37.563
Don't you worry.

01:03:39.649 --> 01:03:42.568
Take your time, Dr. Pyo.

01:03:43.986 --> 01:03:44.904
Have a good night.

01:03:46.155 --> 01:03:48.115
-See you soon.
-Good night.

01:03:50.993 --> 01:03:53.579
Geez, you scared me!

01:03:53.663 --> 01:03:54.497
Kong?

01:03:55.248 --> 01:03:56.082
Yeah, that's her.

01:03:56.165 --> 01:03:57.500
The screamer.

01:03:57.583 --> 01:03:59.001
Quiet, she'll hear you.

01:04:00.294 --> 01:04:02.839
Stop joking around!

01:04:06.175 --> 01:04:07.426
Is it nice to be back?

01:04:08.594 --> 01:04:10.513
They told you to take the weekend off.

01:04:11.764 --> 01:04:13.933
All right, that's a good attitude to have.

01:04:14.016 --> 01:04:16.727
Let me know if you need more work.
You can have some of mine.

01:04:16.811 --> 01:04:18.604
Me too! I have loads to give too.

01:04:19.313 --> 01:04:20.147
We'll see.

01:04:21.649 --> 01:04:23.234
I'm buying to celebrate my return.

01:04:24.861 --> 01:04:26.654
Chocolate Honey Pong Crush for me.

01:04:26.737 --> 01:04:27.572
Me too.

01:04:27.655 --> 01:04:29.240
Two Chocolate Honey Pong Crushes,

01:04:29.323 --> 01:04:31.450
one hot Americano,

01:04:31.534 --> 01:04:32.910
and for Nam-kyung…

01:04:33.536 --> 01:04:35.079
A mega iced Americano.

01:04:35.162 --> 01:04:35.997
All right.

01:04:36.581 --> 01:04:39.292
And one hot peppermint tea, please.

01:04:39.876 --> 01:04:40.918
That's five total, right?

01:04:41.002 --> 01:04:42.086
Yes, that's right.

01:04:42.169 --> 01:04:43.170
Thank you.

01:04:44.297 --> 01:04:45.381
One of these too.

01:04:47.884 --> 01:04:49.093
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

01:04:53.848 --> 01:04:55.391
Your appointment's next week, right?

01:04:56.267 --> 01:04:58.728
If you feel dizzy
or pain in the surgery site,

01:04:58.811 --> 01:05:00.438
don't wait and just come.

01:05:00.521 --> 01:05:01.647
-I can come right away?
-Yes.

01:05:01.731 --> 01:05:03.691
Gosh, thank you so much.

01:05:03.774 --> 01:05:06.193
And please take good care of my Nam-kyung.

01:05:06.277 --> 01:05:09.322
It's so reassuring to know
she has such good friends.

01:05:16.495 --> 01:05:17.955
You can close the shop for a day.

01:05:18.039 --> 01:05:19.665
You should eat lunch before you go.

01:05:19.749 --> 01:05:21.542
Your Dad's working so hard all by himself.

01:05:23.502 --> 01:05:25.046
Tell your friends

01:05:25.671 --> 01:05:28.007
I said thanks for coming to say goodbye,

01:05:28.090 --> 01:05:30.217
for liking my dumplings,

01:05:30.301 --> 01:05:33.387
and for being your good friends.

01:05:33.971 --> 01:05:34.847
All right.

01:05:36.265 --> 01:05:37.558
I could take the bus.

01:05:37.642 --> 01:05:39.435
You just got discharged.
You can take a taxi.

01:05:39.518 --> 01:05:40.686
I'm fine though.

01:05:40.770 --> 01:05:43.147
Mom, it's already been paid for.

01:05:43.230 --> 01:05:45.274
You'll waste money
if you don't take it. You sure?

01:05:45.358 --> 01:05:47.610
Gosh, why waste money
on something like that?

01:05:47.693 --> 01:05:50.529
Just take it.
Skipping one taxi ride won't make us rich.

01:05:50.613 --> 01:05:52.406
Okay, don't get all frustrated.

01:05:56.202 --> 01:05:58.579
Mom, don't come here anymore.

01:06:00.414 --> 01:06:01.832
I'm busy as it is.

01:06:01.916 --> 01:06:04.543
You being here is a hassle for me.

01:06:06.087 --> 01:06:07.171
Geez.

01:06:07.838 --> 01:06:08.756
So,

01:06:09.632 --> 01:06:10.675
don't get sick.

01:06:14.762 --> 01:06:15.930
Okay.

01:06:23.729 --> 01:06:26.065
Were you scared
when they sent you to a big hospital?

01:06:26.148 --> 01:06:27.066
Yeah.

01:06:28.025 --> 01:06:31.737
My vision blurred and my heart raced.

01:06:33.114 --> 01:06:35.574
Were you scared of the surgery?

01:06:36.325 --> 01:06:37.159
Yeah.

01:06:38.327 --> 01:06:39.370
I almost…

01:06:41.372 --> 01:06:42.331
cried.

01:06:43.624 --> 01:06:45.459
The hospital bed was uncomfortable too.

01:06:46.377 --> 01:06:47.628
It was tough, wasn't it?

01:06:48.587 --> 01:06:49.505
No.

01:06:52.800 --> 01:06:54.510
I had a really nice time.

01:06:55.219 --> 01:06:56.053
What?

01:06:56.137 --> 01:06:58.347
It was the first time
since you were in middle school

01:06:58.431 --> 01:07:00.766
that we got to sleep together like that.

01:07:02.518 --> 01:07:03.352
For me,

01:07:04.395 --> 01:07:07.481
it was a really happy three days.

01:07:11.694 --> 01:07:13.487
Why are you saying that?

01:07:13.571 --> 01:07:14.989
My gosh, what's with you?

01:07:18.701 --> 01:07:19.618
Look at this.

01:07:20.202 --> 01:07:21.245
Goodness.

01:07:21.328 --> 01:07:23.998
After always yelling at me
with that temper…

01:07:28.669 --> 01:07:29.670
Mom.

01:07:30.880 --> 01:07:32.214
Don't cry.

01:07:32.298 --> 01:07:33.674
Mom.

01:07:33.758 --> 01:07:36.302
Stop crying, okay?

01:07:36.927 --> 01:07:37.762
Okay.

01:07:38.721 --> 01:07:40.306
-Don't cry.
-Mom.

01:07:41.015 --> 01:07:42.016
Don't cry.

01:07:46.645 --> 01:07:47.813
Mom.

01:07:54.487 --> 01:07:56.155
You're still a baby, aren't you?

01:08:03.245 --> 01:08:04.622
You're eating by yourselves again?

01:08:04.705 --> 01:08:06.082
-Hello.
-Hello.

01:08:06.165 --> 01:08:08.209
Did your mom get home well, Nam-kyung?

01:08:08.292 --> 01:08:09.585
Yes, she did.

01:08:09.668 --> 01:08:11.128
Goodness. You did a great job.

01:08:11.212 --> 01:08:12.379
Thank you.

01:08:18.844 --> 01:08:20.054
Isn't that Yi-young's phone?

01:08:20.137 --> 01:08:21.931
Gosh, she's so absent-minded.

01:08:22.014 --> 01:08:23.474
She was in such a rush.

01:08:23.557 --> 01:08:26.393
If I hadn't told her,
she would've left with her scrubs on.

01:08:29.980 --> 01:08:31.148
Pick it up.

01:08:36.278 --> 01:08:38.447
Hello, this is Oh Yi-young's phone.

01:08:40.241 --> 01:08:41.367
"Are you a thief?" she says.

01:08:41.450 --> 01:08:43.035
Can't you tell by my voice?

01:08:43.661 --> 01:08:45.246
You left your phone at the lounge.

01:08:45.955 --> 01:08:48.374
I'll put it on your desk,
so take it later.

01:08:48.999 --> 01:08:49.834
Bye.

01:08:51.961 --> 01:08:53.045
Did Yi-young go somewhere?

01:08:53.921 --> 01:08:54.964
She had dinner plans.

01:08:55.965 --> 01:08:56.799
With who?

01:08:57.508 --> 01:08:59.343
I don't know who, but I think it's a guy.

01:09:00.010 --> 01:09:01.178
How do you know that?

01:09:01.262 --> 01:09:03.973
Remember that story
about her friend or whatever?

01:09:04.056 --> 01:09:04.890
That?

01:09:05.516 --> 01:09:07.643
You weren't there,
so you don't know, right?

01:09:07.726 --> 01:09:09.436
Someone asked her to dinner,

01:09:09.520 --> 01:09:12.940
but she asked if it was because
he was thankful or he liked her.

01:09:13.023 --> 01:09:14.483
And?

01:09:14.567 --> 01:09:15.985
That it was about her friend.

01:09:16.068 --> 01:09:18.279
Yeah, right. It was totally about her.

01:09:18.362 --> 01:09:20.281
Have you ever seen her meet a friend?

01:09:20.364 --> 01:09:22.158
-No.
-Right?

01:09:22.241 --> 01:09:23.409
She's going to see a guy.

01:09:24.243 --> 01:09:25.452
Welcome.

01:09:25.536 --> 01:09:26.996
The name your reservation is under?

01:09:27.079 --> 01:09:28.747
Ham Dong-ho.

01:09:29.331 --> 01:09:31.792
-We'll take you to your room.
-Room?

01:09:32.334 --> 01:09:33.252
This way.

01:09:42.261 --> 01:09:43.179
Here is your room.

01:09:54.607 --> 01:09:55.524
Come in.

01:10:09.246 --> 01:10:11.916
You didn't show,
so we were scared you had an emergency.

01:10:11.999 --> 01:10:12.833
You don't, right?

01:10:12.917 --> 01:10:13.959
That's right.

01:10:14.043 --> 01:10:17.630
Dr. Ham said he has ordered for us.

01:10:17.713 --> 01:10:19.840
We can have a drink tonight, right?
Take a seat.

01:10:19.924 --> 01:10:20.925
Come on!

01:10:21.008 --> 01:10:22.927
Yeah, we all went through
that night together.

01:10:23.010 --> 01:10:24.011
So we should celebrate.

01:10:24.094 --> 01:10:25.346
Of course we should.

01:10:25.429 --> 01:10:26.680
We saved a baby.

01:10:28.182 --> 01:10:29.934
Weren't we so cool that night?

01:10:30.017 --> 01:10:31.060
Right, Dr. Oh?

01:10:32.061 --> 01:10:33.062
I guess so.

01:10:33.646 --> 01:10:36.232
I think you were the coolest, Dr. Oh.

01:10:37.316 --> 01:10:38.734
But why are you here?

01:10:39.693 --> 01:10:41.111
That really hurts my feelings.

01:10:41.195 --> 01:10:42.947
I'm the one who found Dr. Ku.

01:10:43.030 --> 01:10:44.823
That was the turning point
of that surgery.

01:10:44.907 --> 01:10:46.408
So of course I should be here.

01:10:46.492 --> 01:10:48.077
Of course. "Make the cut deeper."

01:10:48.702 --> 01:10:50.412
Dr. Ku made my heart skip!

01:10:50.496 --> 01:10:52.081
I'll mix the drinks.

01:10:55.334 --> 01:10:58.212
Sometimes, Dr. Ku acts like
he's the lead in a medical drama.

01:10:58.295 --> 01:10:59.755
But he really was cool.

01:10:59.838 --> 01:11:00.965
-Really.
-Wait.

01:11:01.048 --> 01:11:03.133
Yi-young, mix the drinks deeper.

01:11:05.386 --> 01:11:06.553
What are you talking about?

01:11:07.429 --> 01:11:08.764
What is that laugh?

01:11:08.847 --> 01:11:10.099
Here you go!

01:11:10.182 --> 01:11:11.475
Thank you.

01:11:11.558 --> 01:11:12.768
Good job, everyone!

01:11:12.851 --> 01:11:14.645
-Good job!
-Good job!

01:11:22.111 --> 01:11:23.696
-Which way are you going?
-I'm…

01:11:23.779 --> 01:11:24.863
-I'm this way.
-Me too.

01:11:24.947 --> 01:11:26.282
-I'm going this way.
-Me too.

01:11:26.365 --> 01:11:28.158
-Okay.
-See you tomorrow!

01:11:28.242 --> 01:11:29.243
See you tomorrow!

01:11:29.326 --> 01:11:30.995
-What's going on, you two?
-Bye, Yi-young!

01:11:31.537 --> 01:11:33.038
-They make a cute couple.
-Yeah.

01:11:34.581 --> 01:11:37.251
I never thought Dong-ho
would treat us to such a nice place.

01:11:37.334 --> 01:11:38.377
Right?

01:11:38.460 --> 01:11:39.670
I wish he told us earlier.

01:11:39.753 --> 01:11:42.256
Who makes plans the day before?
I almost didn't make it.

01:11:42.339 --> 01:11:44.925
That's better than me.
He only texted me this morning.

01:11:45.009 --> 01:11:47.469
Who cares? Nothing beats a free meal.

01:11:48.929 --> 01:11:50.097
Hey, how about another drink?

01:11:50.180 --> 01:11:52.349
-I have to take care of my kid.
-I have work tomorrow.

01:11:52.433 --> 01:11:54.018
I have to go home and watch TV.

01:11:59.732 --> 01:12:00.774
Are you going home?

01:12:01.400 --> 01:12:02.651
No, to the hospital.

01:12:03.235 --> 01:12:04.820
I left my phone there.

01:12:07.448 --> 01:12:10.075
-About today…
-Yes?

01:12:10.159 --> 01:12:13.037
Did you think it would just be us two?

01:12:13.120 --> 01:12:13.954
No.

01:12:16.081 --> 01:12:17.958
I was worried you'd think it was a date.

01:12:18.042 --> 01:12:19.126
Not at all.

01:12:20.711 --> 01:12:22.963
I'm not the type to easily be mistaken

01:12:23.047 --> 01:12:24.965
or misunderstand things like that.

01:12:25.924 --> 01:12:27.384
I see.

01:12:28.677 --> 01:12:29.762
Now that I think about it,

01:12:29.845 --> 01:12:31.889
I don't think I told you
I invited the others.

01:12:33.891 --> 01:12:35.309
It's okay. I had fun.

01:12:36.852 --> 01:12:37.686
All right.

01:12:39.188 --> 01:12:40.606
Thank you so much for the meal.

01:12:41.774 --> 01:12:42.608
You're welcome.

01:12:44.318 --> 01:12:46.153
Can I ask you something though?

01:12:47.988 --> 01:12:49.448
You don't have to answer.

01:12:51.408 --> 01:12:52.409
Let's hear it first.

01:12:55.245 --> 01:12:56.747
The person you like…

01:12:56.830 --> 01:12:58.082
How did you know?

01:12:59.083 --> 01:12:59.917
So it's true.

01:13:01.251 --> 01:13:02.669
No one knows about that.

01:13:04.546 --> 01:13:06.048
I never told anyone.

01:13:06.715 --> 01:13:08.717
That may be so, but it was obvious.

01:13:09.593 --> 01:13:12.388
We have the best viewing spot in the room.

01:13:13.847 --> 01:13:15.140
Sa-bi's discharge party?

01:13:15.224 --> 01:13:17.101
No, I have dinner plans tomorrow.

01:13:19.103 --> 01:13:21.021
How many times do I have to repeat this?

01:13:21.105 --> 01:13:22.940
I'm substituting for Sa-bi's surgery.

01:13:24.775 --> 01:13:26.235
Three deliveries in a row.

01:13:26.735 --> 01:13:28.404
Are the patient's results in?

01:13:29.405 --> 01:13:30.239
Yes, they are.

01:13:31.281 --> 01:13:32.157
Here.

01:13:32.241 --> 01:13:35.077
We'll deliver the baby
and remove the ovarian cyst today.

01:13:36.161 --> 01:13:38.831
It's larger than expected
and stuck in the back.

01:13:40.165 --> 01:13:42.000
There may be some adhesions.

01:13:48.424 --> 01:13:50.509
Then are we removing this cyst as well?

01:13:50.592 --> 01:13:51.593
That's the bladder.

01:13:52.344 --> 01:13:53.679
Right, thank you.

01:13:53.762 --> 01:13:56.473
I'll go check on Ms. Seong's OR.

01:13:56.557 --> 01:13:57.391
Okay.

01:14:11.822 --> 01:14:12.739
I see.

01:14:14.908 --> 01:14:15.993
So it's that obvious.

01:14:20.372 --> 01:14:22.332
Isn't it tough to have a one-sided crush?

01:14:22.416 --> 01:14:23.500
It is tough.

01:14:24.126 --> 01:14:26.462
These days,
I'm smiling, but not on the inside.

01:14:28.338 --> 01:14:29.173
Then…

01:14:31.258 --> 01:14:32.259
Can't you stop?

01:14:40.350 --> 01:14:41.226
How about me?

01:14:50.944 --> 01:14:52.905
I've never thought about it.

01:14:55.491 --> 01:14:58.410
The one I like
much more than I appear to is…

01:14:59.077 --> 01:15:00.162
Dr. Ku Do-won.

01:15:05.334 --> 01:15:06.251
I'm sorry.

01:15:09.004 --> 01:15:10.255
No need to be sorry.

01:15:13.050 --> 01:15:14.218
I understand.

01:15:15.344 --> 01:15:16.178
Then…

01:15:19.139 --> 01:15:20.807
I'll have to hope you two don't work out.

01:15:21.767 --> 01:15:22.601
What?

01:15:23.185 --> 01:15:24.811
I'll be jealous if it works out.

01:15:27.564 --> 01:15:28.398
Gosh.

01:15:28.482 --> 01:15:31.235
I'm not giving you any ORs from now on.

01:15:31.318 --> 01:15:32.986
Hey, you can't do that.

01:15:33.070 --> 01:15:34.363
Whatever. It's my choice.

01:15:34.446 --> 01:15:36.532
I didn't realize how petty you were.

01:15:36.615 --> 01:15:37.824
Yes, very.

01:15:38.408 --> 01:15:40.410
Still, you can't let
personal feelings affect work.

01:15:40.494 --> 01:15:41.328
Whatever.

01:15:41.411 --> 01:15:43.288
You can't say that. You're a doctor!

01:15:53.048 --> 01:15:54.800
KU DO-WON

01:15:56.802 --> 01:15:59.012
CALL ME WHEN YOU FIND YOUR PHONE

01:16:11.942 --> 01:16:13.110
You didn't bring your car?

01:16:13.986 --> 01:16:14.820
No.

01:16:16.613 --> 01:16:17.447
By the way,

01:16:19.324 --> 01:16:21.827
did you wait to explain
the consent form to me?

01:16:22.452 --> 01:16:23.537
We can do that tomorrow.

01:16:26.039 --> 01:16:28.166
I can handle that much on my own now.

01:16:29.835 --> 01:16:31.712
No, I just thought I might as well…

01:16:32.337 --> 01:16:33.422
And I had some work left.

01:16:35.299 --> 01:16:36.133
Did you eat?

01:16:37.342 --> 01:16:38.594
Yes, with Dr. Ham.

01:16:41.221 --> 01:16:43.265
And the team from that hectic surgery.

01:16:43.348 --> 01:16:45.350
We all celebrated together.

01:16:47.936 --> 01:16:51.148
I had black bean noodles
and sweet and sour pork too.

01:16:51.231 --> 01:16:52.566
And yangjangpi.

01:16:53.358 --> 01:16:54.776
And I had four flower buns.

01:17:00.532 --> 01:17:01.366
You ate a lot.

01:17:13.295 --> 01:17:14.588
I wish I could do that.

01:17:16.965 --> 01:17:17.841
What?

01:17:19.134 --> 01:17:20.636
I want to do that too.

01:17:21.470 --> 01:17:22.304
Here?

01:17:26.516 --> 01:17:27.392
Now?

01:17:28.560 --> 01:17:29.519
Yes.

01:17:36.526 --> 01:17:37.944
Would that be okay?

01:17:43.033 --> 01:17:43.950
I'm…

01:17:47.371 --> 01:17:48.246
Well…

01:17:50.582 --> 01:17:51.667
I'm not so sure.

01:17:52.709 --> 01:17:53.627
But I keep…

01:17:56.338 --> 01:17:57.422
thinking about you.

01:18:02.594 --> 01:18:05.222
My legs hurt a lot
after walking from the hospital.

01:18:06.682 --> 01:18:07.557
Want to sit too?

01:18:08.225 --> 01:18:09.351
Is it too cramped?

01:18:35.377 --> 01:18:37.170
ELEVATED HEART RATE

01:19:58.043 --> 01:20:01.671
THANKS TO OUR SPECIAL GUEST,
SHIN HYUN-BEEN, OUR ETERNAL JANG GYEO-UL

01:20:02.172 --> 01:20:05.425
RESIDENT PLAYBOOK

01:20:05.509 --> 01:20:06.551
Filming?

01:20:06.635 --> 01:20:09.679
They want to see our everyday work lives.

01:20:09.763 --> 01:20:11.681
Just be yourself. Don't force anything.

01:20:11.765 --> 01:20:14.017
And it was in front of film crew
on their first day here.

01:20:14.100 --> 01:20:15.602
Right place, right time.

01:20:15.685 --> 01:20:18.396
It just feels like
the way we met was fate.

01:20:18.480 --> 01:20:21.608
They said a natural birth
was essential for the baby's health.

01:20:21.691 --> 01:20:23.026
Prep with that in mind.

01:20:23.109 --> 01:20:26.279
She forgets to do her own work,
but gets on my case to do better.

01:20:26.363 --> 01:20:27.781
"Did you do it? Are you going to?"

01:20:27.864 --> 01:20:29.825
It's better than "Do it again"
without checking!

01:20:29.908 --> 01:20:31.201
Then check it again now.

01:20:31.284 --> 01:20:32.285
Again, again!

01:20:32.369 --> 01:20:33.286
Hey, be quiet!

01:20:33.829 --> 01:20:35.705
-I'm upset!
-I'm upset!

01:20:35.789 --> 01:20:37.582
Look at this. I knew this would happen.

01:20:37.666 --> 01:20:39.835
"Born in 1996.
Horoscope for second week of October."

01:20:39.918 --> 01:20:41.795
"A week of war
with fights breaking out often."

01:20:41.878 --> 01:20:43.129
That's so annoying!

01:20:43.213 --> 01:20:45.257
I usually don't get angry
at anyone so easily.

01:20:45.340 --> 01:20:47.634
But why do you keep making
ridiculous mistakes?

01:20:47.717 --> 01:20:48.760
It can happen.

01:20:48.844 --> 01:20:51.054
Today's his first day at GYN,
so it's hectic for him.

01:20:51.137 --> 01:20:53.390
Are you trying to lure him over to OB-GYN?

01:20:53.473 --> 01:20:54.683
I might not know everything,

01:20:54.766 --> 01:20:56.893
but I know how to steal someone's heart.

01:20:58.353 --> 01:21:00.230
It's you, right? HI-BOYZ!

01:21:02.274 --> 01:21:04.150
Did I tell you about our trip?

01:21:04.234 --> 01:21:05.485
A trip? All of a sudden?

01:21:06.611 --> 01:21:07.863
They'll be gone for a few days.

01:21:08.488 --> 01:21:09.906
I think they said for four days.

01:21:16.121 --> 01:21:18.123
Subtitle translation by: Jamie Jin
